<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1CO - Lamma</book>
  <para style="h">1Koranti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bituru Labeenɛ Au Gaa beenɛ Yɛnɛ Shɔ KORANTIYI</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Korantiyi</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Ko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bituru Labeenɛ Au Gaa Beenɛ Yɛnɛ Shɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">KORANTIYI</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasi</para>
  <para style="ip">nɛ Bituru Sẽkoo Gbete Gaa Beenɛ Yɛnɛ shɔ Korantiyi <char style="bk" closed="false">Bituru bee labeenɛm nɛu sɔ̃ɔ yukɔnɛ gbete yuu lapaɓa a tete shɔ gɨnnɛyi ɔ̃nɛ a sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗa wɛrɛ gbete Bituru maa au yuu a Koranti. A ɗawuni Koranti si pɛ kpẽenti ɗɔgbete au toli shɔ tipi wɔyi tottot a tipi Girika, shɔ Roomayi ɗɔɔ gaanɛ a tipi Asiya. Shɔ zɛu tɛttɔ a vi pɛlinɛni tottot. U vi pɛlinɛu ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ, vi mɛlinɛ, vi woonɛ, vi zɛnɛ kãnɛ, sẽrẽ kãnɛ, kpãnta pɛlinɛ a nyaba gɨnnɛ tottot.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Jashɔnɛu yɔriyuu ba a yukɔnɛ gbete au yulapa a shɔ gɨnnɛyi tete naa yuu vɔsinɛ a bawaanɛ a Ɗa wɛrɛ, a ruu hɨnnɛ aru nyasiri a zɔtɛnɛ, vigbete i sɨ sissɨn a ɗɔnyɛ, wɛrɛ Ɗa nya ãsinɛ, Suru Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ vi ãnɛ, a yunɛ a saa. A ɓuzɨn dii gbikiri gbikiri tasiu nɔgbete ruutɔ̃vɨn nwanya a ruu hɨlinɛmyɛ. Gɨ̃ngɨ̃n 13, Bituru tasi ɔrinɛ naa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete au tɛɛ vi gãsi a tete vigbete Ɗalapa ãu ɓɛshɔzɛyɛ, wɔɓa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vi pẽniba a yɛti Labeenɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au Ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yuutasinɛ (1. 1 - 9)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yuu vɔsinɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa (1.10 - 4.21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Aru Nyasiri A Ɔ̃nɛ Wɛrɛ (5. 1-7.40.)</para>
  <para style="io1">Shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi A Pagayi (8.1 -11.1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi Ɔ̃nɛ A Bassinɛ (11.2 - 14.40)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesɔ Kirisi yunɛ a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi (15.1 - 58)</para>
  <para style="io1">Shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi vi ãnɛ a Yahudiya (16.1 - 4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nya genɛ a yisinɛ (16.5 -24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />N nkɔ Bulus shɔgbete Ɗalapa ɓau nya nɛu ɔ̃ Kirisi Yesɔ jashonɛ, shoshiu sẽkoo nyageemrɛ au ɓezɔ̃ Sasitɛni-<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Yɛnɛ shɔ sisɨn anɛ a Ɗabii gbete a Koranti, yɛnɛ shɔgbete shɔ ɓai nyanɛ i ɔ̃ Ɗalapa ɓɛshɔzɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ kpai, shɔ gbeteyi pɛ u ɓɛɛyɛ, gbeteyi ɓasi yuu kopiɗɔpiya a Kirisi Yesɔ nii, a shɔgbete i bassi Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi a koo kpai, i ɓeye au ɓɛɛ:<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa u ɓeye a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi u ãwɔ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ a ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛni.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗa vɔɔ Susãri Tasinɛ a Kirisi Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Kopiɗaviya n ɗɔgbete n dɔ̃ri Ɗalapayɛ awɔ yuu aru gbete ãwɔ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔ kabii. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Aru gbete ɔ ɓasi yuu a Kirisi ni ɔ ɔ̃tɛ shɔvinaa ayuu vi piti kpai, ɓasinɛ nyanwanɛ a vizɛnɛni kpai. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Ruu gbete ɔ nta a Kirisi yuu shɔu zɛtɔ awɔ biini. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Aru nankɔ vim ji lɛrɔɔ vɔɔ susãri tasinɛ tɛnɛ ɓa ko gbete, nagbete ɔ ga Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi anɛyɛ <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Ukɔma yɛ sãwɔ sɔ̃njo katakata yɛnɛ lee nyayisinɛ, nɔgbete ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa shɔrukɔ̃linɛ a lee gbete Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi yɛ yeeri shɔ ruu ayuu yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Ɗalapa pɛ shɔ gbete shɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn au bi, Ɗalapa au ɓawɔ nya nɛu pɛli vibiinyatɔ̃nɛ a ɓɛɛ jaa Yesɔ Kirisi ni Uɓeyelapa ni yɛ.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuu Vɔsinɛ Atette Shɔ sisɨn Anɛ Ɗabii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />N shɔbiiyi n gakɔɔtɔ piti kpai au Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi nii, ɔ ɓasiyuu ɔ nya u ɔ̃ gbete ayuu vigbete ɔ shayɛni, nɔgbete yuvɔsinɛ yɛ ɔ̃ tɔɓa awɔ tetteni ɓa. Ɔ yuɓasinɛ u ɔ̃ gbete shɔrɔrɔ, ɔ sisɨn u ɔ̃ gbete ɔ nyashanɛ u ɔ̃ gbete. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Aruviya shɔwɔyi a Kuluwi wɛrɛ i gelin tɛttɔ baras n shɔbiiyi nɛ nyamarinɛ awɔ tɛtɛni. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />N shapɛ naam: ko-piya awɔ tete shajo viwɔ tot. Shɔzɛ gbete shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N gɨnma Bulus&gt;&gt;; wɔsɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;N gɨnma Apolosi&gt;&gt;; wɔnɛ, &lt;&lt;N gɨnma Bituru&gt;&gt;A wɔsɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;N gɨnma Kirisi&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Shɔ vɔsi Kirisitɛ a kn kn ya! Sipɛ Bulus vɔrɛ a laa awɔ yuuni ya? Shɔ pɛlɔɔ batizima naa Bulus jadɔɔyi ya?<verse eid="1CO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />N dɔ̃ri Ɗa tɛ aru n ji pɛli shɔzɛ gbete wɔɔ batizima ɓa awɔ tetteni ɓa see Kiripusi a Gayu. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Shɔwɔyɛ sha dɔɔɓa nɛ, shɔ pɛlɔɔ batizima ɓa ang nii ɓa. ( <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Pɛ nizɛ, n pɛli IStifanu batizima au shɔwɛrɛyini; ama n yɛn kpaa sisɨn dɔɔɓa nɛn pɛli shɔwɔ batizimatɛ toti ɓa.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Kirisi ji shomɓa nɛn pɛli shɔwɔ batizima ɓa. Shon nɛn geli shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn, ji sha ɓa nɛn pɛli vishonɛ a shɔzɛ sẽrẽ ɓa, n ji kasi ɓa Kirisi vɔnɛ a yula u ɔ̃ri shɔ waati weze ɓa.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirisi U pɛ Ɗalapa Kaka Au Sẽrẽ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Aru ruu gbete Kirisi vɔnɛ a yulaa ɔ̃ a shɔgbeteyi niiyɛ bi vikɔ̃linɛ weze; ama au bi shɔgbete shɔ rauyɛ pɛ Ɗalapa kaka. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Ɗa nyaruubii shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">&lt;&lt;N yɛn lɛsi shɔvizɛnɛyi sẽrẽtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">n yɛn pɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi ɓali laatɛ bang vizɛnɛ u ɔ̃ weze.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Kɛɗɔn Shɔ vizɛnɛyi kɛpiya? Shɔ laa ɓali bang i kɛpiya? Shɔ gbeteyi tɔnɛyi zɛnɔɔ nya masinɛtɛ a kotipim kpai i kɛpiya? Ɗalapa tasi tɛttɔ nɛ vizɛnɛ a kotipim waati wezeǃ <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Aru Ɗalapa sẽrẽ shɔzɛ iyɛ zɛ Ɗalapa dɔɔ ɓa ai sẽrẽni ɓa. Naa i si baali ɓaanɛ nɛ&lt;&lt;rãng&gt;&gt;ruu gbete u nwayɛ, Ɗalapa pɔ̃ au sisɨn nɛn raa shɔgbete i ã sisɨn yɛtɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Yahudawayi kãɓɛɛ nɛ shɔu tasiyi vibiizaanɛ gbete yɛ pɔ̃i i ã sisɨnrɛ yɛ, Heliniyawayi kãbɛɛ nɛi kpaa sẽrẽ. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Ɓɛɛ au bi, u nwa ɓɛɛ ruu Kirisi gbete shɔ ɓau naa laayɛ, ruu gbete a Yahudawayi ɗɔbii ɓɛɛ ruuvini, a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i ɗɔbii ɓɛɛ vi rãng; <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />ama a shɔgbeteyi Ɗalapa ɓai nyayɛ bi ko shɔ Yahudawa ko ɓa shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa, ruum ai bi pɛ Kirisi, u pɛ Ɗalapa kaka a Ɗalapa sẽrẽ. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Aru viya vigbete shɔ zɛnɛ Ɗalapa vi rãng pɛlinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete au tɛɛ shɔzɛ sẽrẽyɛ, a vigbete shɔ zɛnɛ Ɗalapa vibiivɔsinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete au tɛɛ shɔzɛ kakayɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Masayi dɔdɔrim ɔ kpaasisɨntɔ nɔgbete ɔ si ɗɔnyɛni, a ɗagbete Ɗalapa ɓawɔ nyayɛ. A shɔzɛ vi zɛnɛ, shɔ kpɛ̃nɛ, shɔ kaka, a shɔgbete i ɔ̃ a dɔlaa pɛ̃niba i si fɛ̃ɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Ɗalapa lɔɔ vigbete a shɔzɛ tuunɛ nɛpɛ vi rãng aru u ã shɔ sẽrẽyi yusẽ, a lɔɔ wɔsɔ̃n vigbete u kaka ɓa ɗɔmɓayɛ aru u ã shɔ kakayi yusẽ. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Ɗalapa lɔɔ vigbete a shɔzɛ zɛnɛ ɓa viwɔ ɓa, ko u vishonɛ ɓa, gbeteyi pɔ̃ a sisɨn nɛ ɓa viwɔ ɓa, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete Ɗalapa pɛli vishonɛ a wuniyɛ aru u lɛsi vigbete shɔzɛ tuunɛ vitɔ̃vɨng yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Vim tasitɛ nɛ, shɔwɔ yɛ baasi ɓa a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Ama Ɗalapa kɔ ɓawɔ nyarɛ nɛ, ɔ ɔ̃ gbete a Kirisi Yesɔ nii, a Ɗalapakɔ pɛlirɛ nɛu ɔ̃ u sẽrẽ. Ukɔ u ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛshɔzɛ Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ai shɔ yai naa wati weze. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Kɛɗɔn ji nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbeteu kɛ tɔnɛn baasitɔ, ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u baasi a vigbete Uɓeyelapa pɛliyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kirisi Ruu Vɔnɛ A Yuu Laa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />N masayi, aɗagbete n awɔ ɗɔbii aru n nwarɔɔ Ɗalapa ruuɓusinɛ tɔ̃vɨn pɛ, n ji pɛli vishonɛ ɓa aru kpete-kpeteyi ɓa a vi matinɛ pẽnɛbayi ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Nagbete sin a ɔkɔniyɛ, n pɔ̃ ang sisɨn n tɔ n yaa vi piti kpai n mati shɔ Yesɔ Kirisi ruu vɔnɛ gbete shɔ ɓau naa laayɛ kɔsheeli. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Kɛɗɔn naa n atɛ awɔ ɗɔbii, n bivɔtɔ piti kpai a setini, <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />n vi matinɛ a Ɗanyruubii ang nwari shɔ n ji pɛli vishonɛ ɓa a shɔzɛ sẽrẽ ɓa, ama n pɛli vishonɛ a vitasinɛ gbete Ɗa Suru tasin yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ji shiɓa a shɔzɛ sẽrẽ ɓa ama shi a Ɗalapa kaka.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Sẽrẽ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />A shɔni piti kpai n nwari shɔ gbeteyi batɛtɔ a sisɨn ãnɛni a Ɗabii ruu sẽrẽ. Ama ɓa sẽrẽ kotipim ɓa ko ɓa kaka gbete sã kotipimyɛ ɓa, kpati roonɛ gbete kaka sɔ̃nyatɔyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Sẽrẽ gbete ang nwarɔɔ yɛ pɛ Ɗalapa sẽrẽ gbete ɓusiyɛ, ɓusi aru shɔzɛ, ama sẽrẽ gbete lɔɔ au ruu bassinɛ, u ɓɛɛ kotipi pɛlinɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Atette shɔgbeteyi i roo kpati a kotipim shɔwɔ ji zɛ sẽrẽ ɓa ɗɔmɓa. Isi tɔnɛn zɛtɔ, i si ji ɓaa Uɓeyelapa shɔ bassinɛ naa ɓa a laani ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Ji nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">&lt;&lt;Vigbete shɔwɔ ji zɛɓa ko ji nta ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Vigbete shɔwɔ ji pɔ̃ɓa a sisɨn nɛyɛ pɛlitɔ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete Ɗalapa ma nɛn yɛ pɛli shɔ gbete i ɔriuyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Ama Ɗalapa tasiu u viɓusinɛ au nyaba suru. Ɗa Suru kɔ kã vi piti kpai, a vigbete Ɗalapa ɓusi gbikiri gbikirini kpai. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Ɓɛ ji suru gbete au bikɔ sheeli zɛ vigbete au yuurɛ piti kpai; sɔ̃nji nankɔ, ji Ɗalapa surukɔ sheeli zɛ vigbete a Ɗalapa yuuni piti kpai. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />U ji tɛ suru kotipim ɓa; ama u tɛ suru gbete Ɗalapa shɔshiutɛ, aru gbete u zɛ vigbete Ɗalapa ãuyɛtɔ piti kpai. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Aru nankɔ u ji nwanya ɓa a sẽrẽ gbete shɔzɛ mati shɔvi a wuniyɛ ɓa, ama a ruu gbete Ɗa suru matiyɛ, naa ukɛ tasi shɔ gbeteyi suru ɗɔn dɔɔ ruu suru tɔ̃vɨnnɛyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Shɔgbete u suru ɓa ɗɔmɓa tɛ vigbete shɛ a Ɗalapa suru naa ɓa. Shɔ naa shɔmi iyɛ zɛ ruu dɔɔɓa nizɛ, yɛ zɛ naa virãng, aru gbete shɔ yɛ zɛu vishonɛ pɛlinɛ ɓɛ ji a Ɗa suru vishonɛkɔ sheeli. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Shɔgbete u suru aɗɔnyɛ, yɛ zɛnɔɔtɔ u yeeruu a vitɔ̃vɨng yuuni piti kpai, ama shɔwɔ yɛ zɛu nɔɔ ruuyeenɛ ɓa au yuuni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">&lt;&lt;Shɔu zɛ Uɓeyelapa sisɨn yɛ piya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">Shɔ gbete yɛ geliu ruuyɛ piya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">U sisɨn Kirisi aɗɔn.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ɗa Jawɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />N masayi pɛ nizɛ n yɛ zɛnɔɔ nyanwanɛ ɓa a ɔkɔni nagbete n nwanya a shɔgbeteyi Ɗa Suru a ɗɔnniyɛ ni ɓa; N kasirɛ n nwanya a ɔkɔɔni naa shɔ kotipimiyi, naa jajjayi gbeteyi ã sisɨn a nyaba Kirisayɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />N shaarɔɔ a mii ɓa vishaanɛ gbete lakitɔyɛ ɓa, aruviya si ɔ ji mabii ɓa nɛi tɛrɛ ɓa. Ama ko dɔdɔrim ma ɔ ji mabii ɓa nɛi tɛttɔ ɓa, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />aru ɔ doo ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ nagbete shɔ kotipimiyi ɔ̃yɛ. Naa gɨnkaanɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ awɔ tetteni ɔkɛ marinyanɛ a zɔni, vim ji tasi kɛ ɓa nɛ ɔ pɛ shɔ kotipimkɔ ɓa ya? Ɔ ɔ̃nɛ ɓa toti a shɔ kotipini ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Naa shɔwɔyi awɔ tete i kɛ shanɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;N gɨn ma Bulus,&gt;&gt; a shɔwɔyi kɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N gɨn ma Apolo&gt;&gt; Ɔ ji pɛlin kɛ ɓa naa shɔ kotipiyi ɓaya? <verse eid="1CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Akɨnti shɔm Piti kpai Apolo ɓɛɛ piya? Bulus kɛ piya? U pɛ Ɗalapa jawɛrɛyi weze, ai kabiikɔ ɔ kpaa sisɨn ãnɛrɛ a Ɗabii. Ko-piya au tete pɛlijo vishonɛ gbete Uɓeyelapa ãunɛ u pɛliyɛ: <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />N ɓaa nɔvitɛ, Apolo ã miirɛ, ama Ɗalapa kɔ pɔ̃rɛ vishau barɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Shɔgbete au ɓaa nɔvisha a shɔgbete ã miiyɛ ɓa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ yuyɔrinɛ ɓa. Ama Ɗalapa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ viyuyɔrinɛ, aruviya ukɔ basi vishaurɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />U vɔsinɛ ɓa atette shɔgbete ɓaa visha a shɔgbete ã miiyɛni ɓa; Kopiya Ɗalapa kɔ yɛ shoriu vi ɗɔnwanɛ jo nɔgbete au vishonɛ sãyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />U pɛ shɔgbete u shoshi Ɗalapa vishonɛyɛ, ɔ pɛ Ɗalapa ɗɔlaanɛ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Ɔ sɔ̃njo ɗɔgbete Ɗalapa maayɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />N pɛli vishonɛ a tɔ̃vɨn gbete Ɗalapa ãnyɛ, n maa dɔjaa naa shɔgbete au zɛnɔɔ ɗɔmaanɛ tɛyɛ, a shɔwɔ u ɗɔɔ ɗɔmaanɛ au yuuni. Ama ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ zɛ nɔgbete ɔ maa viyɛtɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Aru gbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃ Yesɔ Kirisi tɛtɔ nɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ dɔjaa gaanɛrɛ sheeli, shɔ ta dɔjaa wɔɔ tɔɓa. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Shɔwɔyi yɛ pɛli vishonɛ a tarimɛɛ ko tari siliva ko tari au saa yuuni a ɗɔɔ dɔjaa tanɛ; zɔ gãsiyi yɛ pɛli vishonɛ a laa ko wisi ko lagbãng. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Shɔ yɛ zɛ Ko-piya u vishonɛ kaka a leegbete Kirisi yɛ yeeri shɔruu a koo yɛ. Aru nankɔ a lewakɔ yaa yɛ tasi ko-piya u vishonɛ kaka tɔ; yaa yɛ ntau kaka tɔ u tasiu gaanɛ tɔ̃vɨn kɛkn. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Naa vigbete shɔkɛ maanɛ ayuu gɨn-gɨn ɗɔmaanɛuni kɛ shinɛ a yaani, shɔ ɗɔmaanɛu yɛ tɛu vi ɗɔnwanɛtɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Ama a vishonɛu yaa kɛ shaanɛ, a yɛ kpaa viɗɔnwanɛu ɓa; ama a biba a yɛ kpaa naraanɛtɔ, ji naa a ranaa a yaa nawati yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Nizɛ kɔ ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ ɔ pɛ wɛrɛ Ɗa, gbete Ɗa Suru ɔ̃ a ɓuzɨnni yɛ! <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Ɗalapa yɛ lɛsi shɔgbete kɛ lɛsi wɛrɛ Ɗanɛyɛtɔ. Aruviya Ɗalapa wɛrɛ pɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, a ɔ pɛ ɔ yuu ɔ pɛ wɛrɛ Ɗa.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Ɔkɔɔ risɔɔ yuu rãng nɛ. Naa shɔwɔkɛ ɗakiu yuunɛ nɛn ruu kpẽnɛ aɗɔn naa shɔ kotipiyi pɛliyɛ, ɔ risɔɔ yuu ji rãng, aru gbete ɔ ɔ̃kɛ shɔgbete u ruu kpẽnɛ aɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Aruviya vigbete kotipim kɛ tuunɛ nɛ sẽrẽ pɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ virãng a Ɗalapa kabiini. Nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa ɗashɔ ruukpẽnɛyi jo ai ruukpẽnɛkɔ&gt;&gt;; <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />a Ɗanyaruubii wɔɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ shɔruukpẽnɛyi sisɨn ji waati weze.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Kɛɗɔn shɔwɔkɔ baasinɛ a vigbete shɔzɛ pɛliyɛni. Nizɛ kɔ kopiviya ɔ ɓɛɛkɔ: <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Ko Bulus ko Apolo ko Bituru, ko kotipim, ko suru a vɔrɔni, ko vigbete dɔdɔrim ko vigbete kaanɛ a ɗekɨn yɛ kpai ji ɔ ɓɛɛkɔ, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Ɔ pɛ Kirisi ɓɛɛ, a Kirisi u sɔ̃njo Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kirisi Jashonɛyi Vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Ɔ zɛu naa u Kirisi jawɛrɛyi, shɔgbete Ɗalapa ãyi ruu ɓusinɛ tɔ̃vɨn a naa yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Vigbete ko-pi shɔwɛrɛ gbete piya kasiu jawɛrɛyi nɛi pɛliyɛ, u ɔ̃ shɔ gbeteyi shoshiu vishonɛ sisɨn gbete. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Dɔdɔrim, yuu ji wamɓa awɔ ruuyeenɛni ko gbete ɓa, ko shɔu yeeriu ruu a jaruuyeenɛ; nyɛ yeeruu ɓa ang yuuni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Ang zɛnɛ n sisɨn wasa-wasa, ama ji tasi ɓa nɛn ruuvini ɓa yuuni niɓa. Uɓeyelapa kɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete yeeruu ang yuuni. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Aru nankɔ ɔkɔɔ yeeruunɛ a shɔwɔ yuuni naa ɗaa ji pɛli ɓa. Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ruuyeenɛ dangdang u ga ɗagbete Uɓeyelapa yɛ sɔɔyɛ; viɓusinɛ gbete a ɗɔkɨnriyɛ Ɗalapa yɛ n ti a ɗɔsẽsẽ, u shɛshi vigbete shɔ ɓusi a shɔ sisɨnyɛ. Kɛɗɔn kopiya yɛ tɛkɛ bɛlinɛ au shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii nɔgbete u vishonɛ sãyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Aru wɔɔ yuukɔ masayi, n shovim tɛttɔ piti kpai a Apolo yuu ang bibani u ɔ̃ vitasinɛ, aruviya ɔ mati vigbete ruum shayɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ shovi a vigbete nya-ãsinɛ shayɛ.&gt;&gt;Shɔwɔkɔ baasinɛ a shɔwɔni u bɛ̃ɛ̃ shɔwɔ nɔni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Pi gelaa pi nɛ a tɛɛ shɔ gãsiyitɛ piya? Ɓa Ɗalapa kɔ ãa vigbete a wuniyɛ piti kpai ɓaya? Kɛɗɔn a baasi kɛpiruvi naa vigbete a wuniyɛ ɓa Ɗalapakɔ ãrɛ ɓa viya?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Si a kpaa vigbete a kasiyɛ tɛttɔ piti kpai ya? Si a pɛ shɔ vinaa ya? Si ɔ rii kpati tɛttɔ ya, u ɓɛɛ si ji kpati ɓaǃ Ang kasinɛ ɔ si ɔ̃ kpatikɔ nizɛ, nɔgbete u si ɔ̃kɛjo kpatikɔ a nyazɔ a ɔkɔni kpai. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Aruviya ang zɛnɛ u jashonɛyi Ɗalapa ã jaɗɔɔ pẽtẽrẽm ji ukɔ, naa shɔgbete shɔ yeeruu ai yuu nɛi vɔnɛ a shɔnɔɔ, nɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vilatinɛ a Ɗajashonɛlapayi ɗekɨn a shɔkotipiyini piti kpai. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Aru Kirisi yuu u ɔ̃tɛ rãngyi; ama ɔ pɛ shɔruukpẽnɛ a Kirisi kabii! U bi vɔtɛttɔ, ama ɔ kaka aɗɔn! Shɔ bẽutɛ a nɔɔni, ama ɔ kpaa shɔ bassinɛ ɓɛɛtɛ! <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Yɛm dɔdɔrim u rootɛ a nwoni a sutuni; u ji tosi ɓa fãrã tɔ̃vɨn ɓa, shɔ wautɛ, u wɛrɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />U hãu yuutɛ a vishonɛ kaka. Naa shɔkɛ lesiunɛ, u tasi shɔ vɔɔ susãri; naa shɔkɛ tasiu raanɛ, u maa sisɨn; <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Naa shɔkɛ dãunɛ, u sɔriyi a nya zazza. U ritɛ naa ɗɔɔ vi sɨnɛ a koo; U ɔ̃tɛ naa ɗɔpntinɛ gbeteyi sãti a koo anɛ dɔdɔrim! <verse eid="1CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />N beeri vim ji ɔkɔ, ɓa aru n kasaɔɔ yusẽ ãnɛ ɓa, ama n kosɔɔ nya aru ɔ pɛ majaayi gbete n ɔriyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Ko ɔ shɔ kɔnɛyi laa- laa ziti atu kopi ɓa kopi awɔ ɔ̃nɛ Kirisani, ɔ ɓeye ji gbete. Aru nankɔ awɔ ɔ̃nɛ yuu ɓasinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔ ni, nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ ɔ ɓeye aru gbete n n-tɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨnyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />N gakɔɔtɔ ɔ gɨnjo vi n pɛliyɛ <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Arumkɔ n shoshiwɔ Timotirɛ, shɔgbete u pɛ majaa gbete n ɔriyɛ, u shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ shovi gbete naa shɔgɨnnɛyi pɛliyɛ. Ukɔyɛ kpaarɔ sisɨn nɔgbete n gɨn Kirisi Yesɔ a gbete n mati shɔvi a wɛrɛ Ɗa ko-pi ɗɔpiya. <verse eid="1CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Ɔ shɔgãsi ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ vi basinɛ aru ɔ tuunɛ n nyɛ awɔ ɗɔbii tɔɓa. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Naa Uɓeyelapa kɛ kasinɛ, n yɛn atɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti, kɛɗɔn n ang yuu n zɛ kaka gbete shɔ baasinɛmi i a wuniyɛ pɛ, ɓanɛ vigbete i shayɛkɔ sheeli ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Aru Ɗalapa kpati roonɛ ɓa ruu gbete a yulapa nyayɛ kɔ sheeli ɓa ama pɛ au kaka. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Ɔ kasi pi shɔpiya? N awɔ ɗɔbii a kpataya ko a suru shɔ ɔrinɛ a yuu rorinɛ ya?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kpãntang Pɛlinɛ a Wɛrɛ Ɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Nizɛ kɔ shɔ shatɛtɔ dɔdɔrim nɛ kpãntang pɛlinɛ awɔ tetteni waanɛ ko shɔgbete i gɨn Ɗa ɓa ma pɛli ruuvinintɛ jo. Shɔ gelinɛ jawɔ rootɛ a ɓini wɛrɛni! <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Ɔyɛ baasi kɛpi koviya? Ji kɔri ɓa u ɔ̃ nankɔ ɓa tɔ̃ɔtɔ ɔ lesi sisɨntɔ, a jaa gbete au pɛli vimyɛni ɔ shɛshiu kati awɔ tetteni. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Ko n biba gbete n kpɛlɛ a ɔkɔni, n nyazɔ a ɔkɔni a suru; n si tɔnɛn ɔ̃ a ɗɔu a ɔkɔni, n si yeeri jau ruu tɛttɔ a Yesɔ Kirisi nii ni gboti. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Nagbete ɔkɛ toli nyanɛ n suru jo a ɔkɔni, ji naa Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi kaka a ukɔni. <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />Ɔ tuu jau ɔ ãu japẽpẽ a naa aru gbete shɔu lesiu bitɔ, shɔyɛ rau surutɔ a legbete Uɓeyelapa yɛ yee ruu yɛni. <verse eid="1CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Ji kɔriɓa ɔ baasirɛ ɓa! Ɔ zɛ nya shɔ shayɛ tɛttɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt; Jaa yisiti fẽe ukɔ sɨn borodi punɛrɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ zɔ̃ jaa yisiti gbete gbaali ruuvini awɔ bitɔ nɗa ɔ ɔ̃kɛ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ. Kɛɗɔn ɔyɛ ɔ̃kɛ naa borodi sɔɔ gbete au yisiti ɓa ɗɔn ɓayɛ, n zɛtɛttɔ ɔji nankɔ. Aru gbete shɔ ã viyuu ãnɛ jamɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ yuumusinɛ vishaanɛ tɛnɛda tɛttɔ maani, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Kirisi. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />U pɛli viyuumusinɛ tɛnɛda, ama ɓa a borodi gbete au yisiti gbaali ruuvini aɗɔn a lanɛni ɓa. Ama a borodi gbete u yisiti ɓa, ukɛ sɔɔ kɛ borodi gbete au wasak a tɔ̃vɨn ni. <verse eid="1CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />A sẽkɔ gbete n beerɔyɛ n gelɔɔ tɛttɔ n-tɔ ɔkɔ ɓasi yuunɛ a shɔ kpãntangyini. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Dɔdɔrim n ji shaɓa nɛ shɔgbeteyi gɨn Ɗa ɓa ai pɛli kpãntang ko shɔvi kasinɛ bang yi ko ɓooyi ko shɔgbeteyi gɨn vigbete u suru ɓayɛ. Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔkɔ ɔ shɛkati a kotipini dangdang. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Vigbete n shayɛ n-tɔ ɔkɔ ɓasi yuunɛ a shɔgbete i ɓai yuunɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ama i pɛ kpãtang ko shɔgbete vi tɛsiyi ɓa yɛ a shɔ gbete i gɨn vigbete au suru ɓa aɗɔn ɓayɛ ko shɔgbete i dãli shɔyɛ ko shɔgbete a saa sɨiiyɛ ko ɓooyi. Ɔkɔ ɔ̃nɛ nɛi shaa vishaanɛ a shɔmiyini. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />A kɨntiuni piti kpai, yuu ji wamɓa a shɔgbete i ɓa au tetteni ɓa n yeeriyi ruu ɓa a yuu ɓa, ama Ɔyɛ yeeri ruujo shɔgbete i awɔ teteyɛ yuu ɓaya? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛnɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ zɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ kati awɔ atete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mɔkɔ N ti Shɔ Sisɨn Ãnɛ a Jaaruu Yeenɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Shɔwɔ yukɔnɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ aɗɔn a ɓɛzɔwɔ Kirisa ni, yɛ pɛli kɛpi kovi u yaa shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛ gbete i yɛ toyi tete i vɔsiyi barɛ nɛn yɛ shɔgbete i gɨn Ɗa ɓayi ɗɔɔ bi nɛi yeeriyi ruu viya? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ɔ ji zɛɓa nɛ shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi kɔ iyɛ yeeri kotipi ruurɛ ɓaya? Ukɔ tɔ̃ɔ̃, kɛɗɔn, naa ɔkɔ kɛ yeeri kotipi ruunɛyɛ, ɔyɛ zɛnɔɔ jaaruu fɛ̃ɛ̃m yeenɛ dɔɔ ɓaya? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Ɔ ji zɛɓanɛ uyɛ yeeri Ɗajashonɛlapayi ruutɔ ɓaya? Vigbete Kotipim kɛ nɛkɨn nya awɔ ɔ̃nɛmni viya? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Iri vim kaanɛ, ɔyɛ tuurɛ a n ti kɛ shɔgbete i ɓa shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi ɓa nɛi kɔriruurɛ ya? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Viyusẽe awɔ yuu! Ɔ shɔ sẽrẽ wɔɓa awɔ tetteni ko gbete au yɛ vɔsɔɔ bang dɔɔɓa awɔ ɔ̃nɛ shɔ gɨnnɛ ni ɓaya. <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Arumkɔ, shɔ Kirisa yɛ tuu ɓɛzɔ̃ Kirisa yɛ n-tiu a shɔgbete i gɨn Ɗa ɓayɛ naa nɛu yeeriyi ruu! <verse eid="1CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Ruugbete awɔ n ti zɔ a ɗɔɔ ruu yeenɛ u ɔkɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɔ awɔ nɔɔ si ɔ nwesitɛttɔ gboti. Ji tɔ̃ɔ̃ ɓa ɔ roo awɔ yuu vigbete ɔ pɛli a mɛzɔ kirisita ni ɓaya? kɛɗɔn ɔ̃nɛ arumkɔ a n ti mɛzɔ jaaruuyeenɛrɛ, Ji kɔri ɓa shɔu kulaa nɔɔtɔ ɓaya? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Ɔ pɛ awɔ nɔɔ ɔ lɛsi zɔ vitɔɔ a kuli zɔ nɔɔrɛ, ji nankɔ a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ wɔyini. <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Nizɛ kɔ ɔ zɛtɛttɔ shɔ lanɛyi iyɛ kpaa Ɗa kpati roonɛ ɓa. Ɔkɔ riisɔɔ yuu rãng nɛ; shɔ gɔnlɔrɔyi ko shɔ vaa gɨnnɛyi ko shɔ kpãntangyi ko shɔgbete i roo ai nɔɔ vɔshɔyi yɛ <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />ko shɔgbeteyi ɓɔɔ ɓɔyɛ ko shɔgbete vi tɛsiyi ɓa yɛ ko shɔgbete i ɓoo saa bang yɛ ko shɔgbete i shavi a shɔ yuu gbete ɓa ntɔ ɓa yɛ ko ɓooyi iyɛ shɔmiyi kpai i kpaa Ɗa kpati roonɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Ɔ zɔ̃ gãsiyi i sijo nankɔ. Ama shɔ sɔwɔɔ tɛttɔ tɛpɛ -tɛpɛ a ruuvini naani; Shɔ ãwɔ tɛttɔ a Ɗa naa; shɔ pɔ̃wɔ tɛttɔ a Ɗa ɗekɨn a kaa Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi u Ɗalapa suru.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shoshi Ɗalapa Vi Awɔ Bi Ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Shɔwɔ yɛ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔ ãng nyabatɛ nɛn pɛli vigbete n kasi pɛlinɛ yɛ piti kpai.&gt;&gt;Nizɛ; ama ɓa vi piti kpai tɔ̃vɨn awɔ biini ɓa. N yɛn shanɛ shɔ yasin nyabatɛ nɛn pɛli vi piti kpai, n yɛn kasi ɓa nɛn yaa viwɔrɛ nɛu risin u foo ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Shɔwɔyɛ sha sɔ̃n ji nɛ,&lt;&lt;Kn pɛ yɛti ɓɛɛ, yɛti sɔ̃njo kn ɓɛɛ.&gt;&gt; Nizɛ; ama Ɗalapa yɛ n ti ko-pi vigbete piya u nyayisinɛtɔ. Shɔji pɛli bi ɓanɛ shɔu roori a zɔni ɓa, ama nɛ shɔu shoshi Uɓeyelapa vi awuni; Uɓeyelapa ukɔ yɛ ã yɛti virɛ. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Ɗalapa yusi Uɓeyelaparɛ a saa, ukɔ ma yɛ yusiu lapa sɔ̃njo au kaka. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Ɔ zɛtɛttɔ nɛ ɔ gboki bi pɛ Yesɔ ɓɛɛ. N yɛn tuu Kirisi gboki bi kati nɛn risiu vi roorinɛ a zɔni ya? Yɛ pɛli ɓa! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Wɔba ɔji zɛɓa nɛ shɔgbete au kɛ tuu u binɛ u ɓasi a suu kpãntang ɓɛɛ i ɔ̃kɛ gbete awuni ɓaya? Ɗanyaruubii shaji ɓili weze nɛ,&lt;&lt; Shɔzɛ ziti iyɛ ɔ̃kɛ gbete.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Ama shɔgbete kɛ ɓasiu binɛ Uɓeyelapani yɛ ɔ̃kɛ suru gbete awuni.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Ɔ yaa kpãntang pɛlinɛ kati. Ruuvini gbete shɔwɔ pɛliyɛ ɗiu bi ɓa; ama shɔgbete kɛ pɛli kpãngtang nɛ si pɛliu bi ruuvinitɛ. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Ɔ ji zɛɓa nɛ ɔ bi pɛ wɛrɛ Ɗa gbete Suru Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ u a ɓuzɨn ni gbete Ɗalapa ãwɔyɛ ɓaya? Ɔji zɛɓanɛ ɔ yuu ɓa ɔ ɓɛɛ ɓa, pɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ; <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Ɗalapa wootɔ a vitɔ̃vɨng wɔɔ pẽniba au shanyatɔ yɛ. Arumkɔ ɔ shovi awɔ biini a ɗɔɔ Ɗalapa bassinɛ.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ruu Hɨnɛ Aru So Tɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Dɔdɔrim, nyakasinɛ aru nyanwanɛ gbete n beerɔɔ yɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">Tɔ̃ɔtɔ vɔshɔ u ɔ̃ weze u tɛ so ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Ama aru gbete kpãntang pɛlinɛ aɗɔn bang, ko-pi vɔshɔ gbete piya u ɔ̃ a soni, a ko-pi soro gbete piya u kpaa vɔshɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Ko-pi vɔshɔ gbete piya u pɛli vi jo naa shɔwɛrɛ pɛliyɛ, soro u pɛli vi naa suu yuwɛrɛ, i ziti piti i pɛli zɔjo nɔgbete i kasiyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Sorou bi ɓau ɓɛɛ ɓa, ama pɛ ɓɛvɔ ɓɛɛ; sɔ̃njo nankɔ ɓɛvɔ bi ɓau ɓɛɛ ɓa, ama pɛ ɓɛso ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Ɔkɔɔ zãrɔɔ zɔ binɛ, see naa ɔkɛ kasinɛ ɔ pɛli aɗagbete ɔ gaki Ɗa yɛ; ama ɔ sɔɔ sɔ̃njo naa vɔshɔ a soro. A nyabankɔ ɔkɛ pɛlinɛ japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ yɛ kpaa nyaba tonɛtɔ awɔ yɛtini aru gbete ɔ jo sãwɔ yuu ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />N jo gelɔɔ vim ɓa nɛn ãsɔɔ nyaɓa, ama aru nyaba yasinɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />N kasi jo ɔ ɔ̃ jo naa n ɔ̃ yɛ; ama ko-piya u jo a vigbete Ɗalapa ãuyɛni, shɔzɛ gbete u a vi shɔm, shɔwɔ u sɔ̃njo a vi shɔwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Dɔdɔrim, a shɔgbete i ji tɛ so ɓai yuu a shɔgbete i ɓɛvɔ vɔtɛttɔyɛ, n shanɛ yɛ kɔritɔ ɔ ɔ̃ nagbete ɔ ɗɔnmi ɔ sãwɔ yuutɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Ama naa akɛ zɛnɛ ɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ ɓa a yɔbũni ɓa ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a so tɛnɛ ni kɔritɔ shɔu tɛ so a gbete ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ a nɔɔ taanɛni a so biiyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Aru shɔgbete i tɛ sotɛyɛ, n ãsɔɔ nyatɛ, ama ɓang n nya ãsinɛ ɓa pɛ Uɓeyelapa ɓɛɛ: sorokɔ yaa ɓɛvɔ wɛrɛnɛ; <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />ama naa kɛ pɛlinɛ, ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u ɔ̃ a yɔɓũ ko i yasi zɔ ruuvinitɔ a ɓɛvɔni; ɓɛvɔ kɔ ãu sẽkoo vɔsinɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />N geli zɔ gãsiyi nɛ (N ang yuu, ɓa Uɓeyelapa ɓa): naa shɔ Kirisa ɓɛso u sitɛ ɓa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa kɛ kasinɛ nɛn ɔ̃ a wuni, ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng a akɔrɔ ukɔ vɔsinɛ awuni. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />A naa suu Kirisa i kɛ tɛzɔnɛ a shɔgbete u ɓa Kirisa ɓa, naa kɛ tɔnɛ nɛn ɔ̃ a wuni, ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ukɔ vɔsinɛ awuni. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Aru vɔshɔ gbete ã sisɨn ɓa yɛ kɛ ɓasi yuunɛ a ɓɛsoni, Ɗalapa yɛ tɛutɔ aru yuuɓasinɛ gbete i pɛli a ɓɛsoniyɛ, a soro gbete u sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa ɗɔm ɓa Ɗalapa yɛ tɛu sɔ̃njo aru yuuɓasinɛ gbete i ɓasi a ɓɛvɔɔ Kirisa ni yɛ. Vim si ji ɔ̃ ɓa nankɔ ɓa ɓɛjaayi i si ɔ̃ naa shɔgbete i bassi Ɗa ɓa ɓɛɛjaayi; ama nagbete ɔ̃ yɛ Ɗalapa tɛitɛttɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Ama naa shɔgbete kɛ kasi vɔsinɛ nɛ a shɔ Kirisani i vɔsirɛ. Vim jo ɔ̃ri shɔ Kirisa vɔshɔ ko soro shɔ yasiu nyabatɛ u pɛli vigbete au kasi pɛlinɛyɛ. Ɗalapa ɓawɔ nya nɛ ɔ ɔ̃ atette sisɨn puru. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Mɔkɔ Suu yuwɛrɛ sisɨn ãnɛ, a yɛ zɛkɛpi kovi nɛn yɛ ran ɓɛvɔ dɔɔɓa viya? Ko mɔkaa vɔshɔ, a yɛ zɛkɛpi kovi nɛn yɛ ran ɓɛso ɓa viya?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ ɔ̃ ji Naa gbete Ɗalapa Ɓawɔ Nyayɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Ko-pi shɔgbete piya u ɔ̃ ji naa gbete Uɓeyelapa ãuyɛ, nagbete ɔ siɗɔn a Ɗalapa ɓawɔ nyayɛ. N pɛ vigbete n mati a wɛrɛ Ɗa piti kpai. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Nagbete shɔgbete shɔ yeeriu shaatɛ kɛ tɛ Ɗalapa nya ɓanɛ nɛ, ukɔ kã nyaba gbete yɛ ɔ̃ naa shɔji yeeriu shaa ɓanɛ. Shɔgbete shɔji yeeriu shaa ɓa kɛ kasi Ɗalapa nya ɓanɛ nɛ, ukɔ tɔnɛ nɛ shɔkɔ yeeriu shaa nɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Ko shɔ yeera shaatɛ ko shɔji yeera shaa ɓa, shaa yeenɛ ɓa viwɔ ɓa; vigbete au yɔri shɔ yuuyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa nya ãsinɛ gɨnnɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Ko-piya u ɔ̃ jo nɔgbete au ɔ̃ sijiyɛ a ɗagbete tɛ Ɗalapa nya ɓanɛyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />A ɗagbete Ɗalapa ɓa nyayɛ asi jafoo ya? Mɔkɔ yɔri yuunɛ, ama akɛ kpaa ɔ̃nɛ nɛ a yuu, shɔvinɛ awuni. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Shɔgbete usi jafoo a shɔ kɛ ɓau nyanɛ anɛ Uɓeyelapa ɗɔbii upɛ Uɓeyelapa ɓɛɛ. Sɔ̃njo nankɔ a shɔgbete usi ɓa jafoo ɓa ni, Kirisi kɛ ɓau nyanɛ yɛ ɔ̃kɛ Kirisi jafoo. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Ɗalapa woo aa saa parara; ɔkɔ ɔ̃nɛ shɔzɛ jafoo. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Masayi, nɔgbete shɔ kpawɔrɛ a shɔ ɓawɔ nya a ɓuzɨniyɛ ɔ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo nankɔ a Ɗalapani.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruu hɨnɛ aru Shɔgbeteyi Soɓa a Suvɔyini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Vigbete ɔ bee dɔdɔrim aru shɔgbete i jo tɛ soɓayɛ: N ji kpaa nya ãsinɛ wɔɓa a Uɓeyelapa ɗɔbii ni ɓa, ama ang zɛnɛ shɔgbete Uɓeyelapa au tete shɔratãnɛ ɔ̃tɛ u kasiu ruu bitɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Zɛnɛ gbete nya yuɓam, naa shɔ sijo tɛso ɓa u naa ɔ̃ji nagbete ɔ̃ ɓangkɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />A ji tɛ so ɓaya? Kɛɗɔn mɔkɔ tɔnɛn kã so tɛnɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Ama akɛ tɛ sonɛ si a jo pɛli ruuvini ɓa. Suu gbete u vɔshɔ ɓa kɛ tɛ vɔshɔnɛ si jo pɛli ruuvini ɓa. Ama shɔgbete i tɛso yɛ iyɛ ɓoraatɔ, n kasirɛ n rawɔtɔ a raɓoonɛ mini.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Vigbete n shami masayi, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ, ɗagbete shɔ pɔ̃yɛ tɔkɨn bang ɓa, Yunɛ dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn, shɔgbete i tɛso yɛ i ɔ̃ naa i jo soɓa; <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />shɔgbete i sɨnyɛ, i ɔ̃ naa i sisɨn ji lɛsi ɓa; shɔgbete i ɗɔɔ latinɛ, i ɔ̃ naa i jo nta binyatɔ̃nɛ ɓa; shɔgbete i woo viyɛ, i ɔ̃ naa i viwɔ ɓa; <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />shɔgbete i shɔvi a vi kotipim i ɔ̃ naa i si ɓa awuni ɓa. Aru kotipim, nɔgbete u ɗɔnmi dɔdɔrim, nagbete kotipi yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa dɔkɔkɔ ni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />N kasirɛ ɔkɔ ɔ̃nɛ atette yɛti lɛrinɛ. Shɔgbete jo tɛso ɓa ã yuu a Uɓeyelapa vishonɛ, aruviya kasinɛ Uɓeyelapa ntawɔ tɔ̃vɨntɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Ama shɔgbete u so ɗɔnyɛ lɛri ɓɛjo a ruu vi kotipi, aru gbete kasi ɓɛso u ntau tɔ̃vɨn a sisɨn roorinɛ; <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />u sisɨn vɔsi kɛ ɗɔɔ ziti. Suu gbete ji tɛ vɔshɔ ɓa ko jasu nyara ã sisɨn ɓɛjo a Uɓeyelapa vishonɛ, aru gbete kasi yuu ãnɛ au suruni Uɓeyelapa; ama suu gbete au tɛ vɔshɔ tɛttɔ ã yuu ɓɛjo a vi kotipi, aru gbete kasi ɓɛvɔ sisɨn roorinɛ.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />N gelɔɔ vim aru n kasɔɔ naa pɔ̃sinɛ. N jo pɛli ɓa nɛn kasɔɔ ɓɔ̃nɛ ɓa. N kasirɛ ɔ pɛli jo vitɔ̃vɨng au dang yɛ, ɓa a sisɨn vɔsinɛ niɓa. <verse eid="1CO 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Jawɔɔ au maruu a nyarãni nɛn tɛ zɔtɔ, ama ji sãu yuu ɓa, naa kɛ zɛnɛ nɛn jo pɛli ɓa vikɔ̃linɛ ɓa a jasuu ni ɓa, kɛɗɔn kɛ zɛnɛ naa i tɛ zɔtɔ se i tɛrɛ. Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔkɔ jo pɛli ruuvini ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Ama shɔgbete a shɔji sɨuɓa nɛu pɛli nankɔ ɓa, kɛ pɔ̃nɛ au sisɨn nɛn tɛ so ɓa, naa kɛ ɔ̃nɛ jou kasinɛ au yuu sãnɛni naa gbete si sɨtɛttɔ au sisɨn ni vigbete nɛn pɛliyɛ- kɛɗɔn si pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨntɛ aru gbete jo tɛ jasu ɓa ni. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Naa shɔu kɛ tɛ sonɛ si pɛlitɛ tɔ̃vɨn, ama shɔgbete ji tɛ so ɓa si ukɔ pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng barɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Soro yɛ vɔsi ɓa a ɓɛvɔni u doo nɔkãkãri ɓa; ama ɓɛvɔ kɛ vɔnɛ, kɛɗɔn si kpaa nyaba gbete au yɛ tɛ shɔgbete au kasiyɛtɛ, ama se shɔgbete u shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Kirisi biiyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Ang zɛnɛ Suu yɛ nta sisɨn purutɔ waanɛ, naa kɛ ɔ̃nɛ nankɔ ji tɛ vɔshɔ ɓa, n zɛ naa n sɔ̃njo a Ɗalapa Suruni.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ruu hɨnɛ ayuu Vishaanɛ Gbete Shɔ ã vaayɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Vigbete a bee dɔdɔrim a yuu vishaanɛ gbete shɔ nwari vaayɛ. Pɛ nankɔ nizɛ,&lt;&lt;U piti kpai u zɛ tɛttɔ,&gt;&gt; pɛ nizɛ. Vi naa vi zɛnɛm, sɨ shɔ shɔu basi yuu; ama u zɔ ɔrinɛ gbete u a wuniyɛ ukɔ ãu kakarɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Shɔgbete i tɔnɛ i zɛ vi tɛttɔ waanɛ, i ji zɛ ɓa nagbete isi zɛyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Ama shɔgbete kɛ ɔri Ɗalapa nɛ, Ɗalapa yɛ zɛu ɓɛjirɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Ama aru vaa vishaanɛ gbete shɔ shaa yɛ: U zɛtɛttɔ vaa pɛ vigbete au suru ɓayɛ; u zɛtɛttɔ Ɗalapa ji gbete. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Ko vi shɔ ɓanɛ &lt;&lt;ɗa miyi&gt;&gt;a kolapa ko a kotipi i bang, &lt;&lt; ɗawi&gt;&gt;a &lt;&lt;Shɔ kpati roonɛyi,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />a shɔmni piti kpai u Ɗalapa ji gbete, Uɓeye, shɔgbete au kɔri vi piti kpai au ɔ̃ au yuuyɛ; a Uɓeyelapa ji gbete, ukɔ Yesɔ Kirisi, au kabiikɔ shɔ shɛshi virɛ piti kpai, u shɛ jo au kabiikɔ u ɔ̃rɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Ama ɓa shɔ piti kpai i zɛ tɔ̃vɨnrɛ ɓa. Shɔwɔyi i ɗɔɔ vishonɛ a vaani anɛ nɛm, naa i kɛ shaa vaa vinɛ i lɛri ai sisɨn nɛi shaa vaa vishaanɛ; aru gbete i sisɨn ji laki ɓa, i zɛ ai nɔɔ naa vi shaanɛukɔ lɛsiyirɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Vi shaanɛ yɛ n-tiu ɓa a Ɗa ɗɔbiini maani ɓa. U ji shaa ɓa viwɔ yɛ lɛriu ɓa, ukɛ shaanɛ u yɛ kpaa viwɔ ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Ɔ kɔbiitɔ aru gbete ɔ ɔ̃nɛ awɔ yuu yɛ sɨ shɔwɔyirɛ gbete i sisɨn ji laki ɓa nwẽrɛ a yɛti ruuvini. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Naa shɔgbete u sisɨn ji laki ɓa kɛ zɛnɛ a shɔgbete a ɓaa yuunɛ nɛi zɛ &lt;&lt;vitɛttɔ bang,&gt;&gt; ɔ ɗɔɔ vi shaanɛ a javaa; vimkɔ yɛ sɨu ɓa u shaa vaa vi ɓaya? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Kɛɗɔn jinankɔ shɔgbete u sisɨn ji laki ɓam, mezɔ̃u gbete Kirisi vɔ au yuum yɛ ɓoraatɔ aa &lt;&lt;ruu vizɛnɛnkɔ&gt;&gt;! <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />A nyabankɔ a yɛ pɛli Kirisi ruuvinitɔ aru gbete a sɨ shɔ Kirisa gãsiyi gbeteyi sisɨn ji laki ɓa i pɛli vigbete ɓa tɔ̃ɓa yɛtɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Kɛɗɔn naa vishaanɛ kɛ sɨ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi ruuvini pɛlinɛ nɛ, n yɛn shaa yɔpɔ tɔɓa, aru nɔgbete yɛ sɨ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ nwẽsi a yɛti ruuvini ɓa.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Vishonɛ gbete Jashonɛ Tɔ̃rɛ i pɛliyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />N nyaba ɔ̃nɛ ɓa wezeni ɓaya? N ɓa jashonɛ ɓaya? N jo zɛ Yesɔ Uɓeyelapa ɓaya? Ɔ ɓan n vishonɛ gbete n pɛli Uɓeyelapa yɛ ɓaya? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Ko naa shɔwɔyi kɛ ɓɛ̃nn nɛ nɛn n ɓa jashonɛ ɓa, nizɛ n pɛ jashonɛ awɔ ɗɔbii. Ɔkɔ ɔ̃rɛ n shɔ shirinɛ a Uɓeyelapa kabii. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />N pɛ nɔgbete n rang yuuyɛ a shɔgbete i yeerin ruu a yuuyɛ yi naa. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />N ji yɛ ɓa a nɔgbete shɔu ang vishaanɛ a miɓoonɛni aru vishonɛ gbete n shoyɛ ɓaya? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />N nyaba gbete n gɨn jashonɛ gãsiyi vishonɛ gbete i pɛli Uɓeyelapa ɓezɔyi a Bulus ni ɓaya? N yɛ zɛnɔɔ suu gbete tɛu u Kirisa n yɛ zati awuni baya? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Ko Barnaba a nkɔni ukɔu shariu yuu ɓɛkɛjoya? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Pi soja gbete pi yɛ shovi nɛn shaari u yuu piya? Pi yɛ lajaa inabii au yɛ shau jaa ɓa yɛ piya? Pi ga napu pi u bɛ̃ɛ̃ miinapu noni piya? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />N sha ruum aru vigbete jashɔzɛyi shayɛ ya? Musa nya ãsinɛ ji sha ɓa ɗɔkɔ ɓaya? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Shɔ bee tɛttɔ a Musa labeenɛ nya ãsinɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔkɔ ma napu nyanɛ a ɗagbete i ɗɔɔ zee waanɛni.&gt;&gt; Ɗalapa kɔkɛjo napu kɔ sheeli ya? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Ji shaɓa ji au yuu kɔ ɓaya? Nizɛ shɔ bee vim ji au yuukɔ. Shɔgbete kɛ lajaanɛ a shɔgbete au yee vishauyɛ i pɔ̃ sisɨntɔ nɛi yɛ kpaa viwɔtɔ a jaawuni. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />U ɓaa novi surutɛ awɔ tetteni. Naa ɔkɛ yee jaanɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃n kɛ bang, naa ukɛ kpaa viɗɔwanɛ nɛ awɔ naa ya? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Naa shɔwɔyi nyaba pɛlinɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn, u nyaba pɛlinɛ yɛ tɛ i ɓɛɛ ɓaya?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Ama u jo pɛli vishonɛ ɓa a nyabani ɓa. U maa sisɨntɛ a vimni piti kpai aru gbete u yɛ kpaa vidɔɔ kɔnɛrɛ a nyaba ruutɔ̃vɨng a Yesɔ kirisi yuu. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Ɔ ji zɛɓanɛ shɔgbete i shɔvi a Ɗa wɛrɛ i kpaa vishaanɛ jo a ɗɔukɔ ɓaya? A shɔgbete i kɛ shovinɛ a laa zã i kpaa i ɓɛɛ jo a ukɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Ji nyabangkɔ Uɓeyelapa ãsi nyanɛ shɔgbete i kɛ nwa Ɗa ruubiinɛ i kpaa i vishaanɛ jo ɗɔukɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Ama n jo shovi ɓa a nyaba gbete n kpaa mini ɓa ko gbete. Ɓanɛ n ɗɔɔ vim beenɛ dɔdɔrim nɛ shɔu pɛlin namkɔ ɓa, se n vɔtɔ kang gbete shɔ zãrin basinɛ au yuuniyɛ! <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />N nyaba basinɛ ɓa aru gbete nɛn nwa Ɗalapa nyarubii yɛ ɓa. Au kɨnti ni piti kpai shɔ pɔ̃ntɔ nɛn pɛlitɔ. Yɛ ɔ̃rin viyuukɔnɛ naa n jo nwari shɔ Ɗalapa nyarubii ɓayɛ! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Naa nkɛ pɛlin vishonɛ nɛ nagbete n kasiyɛ, n yɛn pɔ̃ sisɨntɔ aru shorinɛni; n pɛli pɛ aru gbete pɛng vishonɛ gbete Ɗalapa ãng nɛn pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />N kpaa kɛpi vishorinɛ shɔpiya? Nyarubii tɔ̃vɨn nwanɛ ɓanɛ shɔu shorintɔ ɓa. Ɓang tunɛni ang nyaba vishonɛ aru Ɗalapa nyarubii. <verse eid="1CO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />N jo ang yuu, n ɓa shɔ wɔ foo ɓa; ama n tuun yuu naa kopiya foo a nɔgbete n gɔ̃ shɔ waanɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Naa n ɗɔɔ vishonɛ a Yahudawayi n sɔrin yuu naa Yahudawa a nɔgbete n yɛn gɔ̃nyi yuuyɛ; n ɓa shɔgbete n gɨn nya ãsinɛ Musa ɓa, n ɔ̃ naa shɔgbete i gɨn nya ãsinɛ Musa yɛ aru gbete n yɛn gɔ̃yiyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Sɔ̃njo nyaba naa shɔmkɔ naa n kɛ shovinɛ a shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa yɛni. N ɔ̃ naa shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa, a ɓili ɓa tete Yahudawayi nya ãsinɛ ɓa, a nɔgbete n yɛn gɔ̃yiyɛ. Shom ji tasiɓanɛ n gɨn Ɗalapa nyaãsinɛ ɓa ɓa; n pɛ jo atette Ɗalapa nya ãsinɛ gɨnnɛ kɔ; n pɛ jo atette Kirisi nya ãsinɛkɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />A tete shɔgbeteyi sisɨn ji laki ɓayɛ n ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo nankɔ a yini, aru gbete n kasiyi gɔ̃nɛ. N ɔ̃ nankɔ a yini n kasirɛ n raa shɔ gãsiyitɔ ko-pi nyaba gbete piya. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />N pɛli vim piti kpai aru Ɗalapa nyarubii n kpaa vɔɔ susãri tasinɛtɔ ang biini. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Ɔ ji zɛ ɓa nɛ shɔ kɛ maasi dɔɔ yunɛnɛ a shɔzɛ bang ni ko-piya kasirɛ nɛn yurɛ nɛn tɛɛ zɔ gãsiyitɔ ɓaya? Ama shɔzɛ gbete ukɔ kpaa ɗekɨn tɛnɛrɛ u shaa lamba gbeterɛ. Ɔ yunɛ a nɔgbete ɔ yɛ kpaa lamba gbete shaanɛyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Shɔ shoshɛnɛyi i mati yuu vitɔ sisɨn gbete, aru gbete i kpaa salabu gbete lɛsitɔ maanɛtɔ a yuu; ama u pɛli nam aru gbete u kpaa shɔgbete lɛsi ɓayɛ dangdang. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Arugbetekɔ n yunɛ ɓa weze ɓa, n naa gbete n miyɛ n waa ɓa soro wuni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Ama n risin yuu jafoo n matiu vi aru gbete nkɛ nwari shɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubiinɛ yɛnɛ lɛyisinɛ shɔu zãrin viɗɔɔ nwanɛrɛ ɓa.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ruu Hɨnɛ Aru Vaa Gɨnnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />N kasirɛ ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ masayi, aru vigbete au kpaa u ɓeuru gbete i gɨn Musa nya yɛ. Shɔ kukiyi a nyasii piti kpai i kpaa tɛnɛ mii waapo darɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Shɔ pɛliyi shɔgbete i gɨn Musa batizima a nyasi a mii waaponi kpai. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />I shaa jo borodi gbete au ã suruyɛ kɔ piti kpai <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />i piti kpai i ɓoo jo mii gbete au ã suruyɛkɔ. I ɓoo mii jo kɔpɔnkɔ au ã suruyɛ au yɛ a yiniyɛ; kɔpɔu sijo Kirisi au yuu. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Ama ko si Ɗalapa bi jo ntɔu nya ɓa a yini ɓa, a shɔ sãtiyi vɔrɔ a ɗɔgbete laa si ɓa ɗɔn bang ɓa piti kpai. <verse eid="1CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Dɔdɔrim vim pɛ vigbete u yɛ kpaa gɨn ɗɔnyɛ aru gbete u yɛ kasi vikɔ̃linɛrɛ nagbete i pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Ɔkɔ ɔ̃nɛ shɔgbete i gɨn vigbete u suru ɓayɛ nagbete zɔ gãsiyi pɛliyɛ, Nagbete shɔ bee a labeenɛ Ɗanyarubii nɛ, &lt;&lt; Shɔwi i ɔ̃ tɛ i ɗɔɔ shaanɛ, i ɗɔɔ ɓoonɛ, i tɔ sasanɛ a kpãntang pɛlinɛni .&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Jo ɔ̃riu ɓa kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u pɛli kpãntang ɓa, naa i zɔ gãsiyi pɛliyɛ ɓa, a leegbete isi bi laa-laa kopi atu jaa maani ɓa taati ai vɔyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Ji ɔ̃riu ɓa kaka jaazɨ a kɔrɔ nɛ u nta Uɓeyelapa sisɨn ɓa, naa i zɔgãsiyi pɛliyɛ sɔɔ yɔkiyirɛ i vɔliyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Ukɔu nwa nyanɛ naa i zɔgãsi i nwayɛ a Ɗalapa jashonɛ lapa gbete i yɔ̃ vɔrɔ i arɛ i yɔ̃kiyi vɔrɔ kpai. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Vim pɛlirɛ a yini piti kpai nɛu ɔ̃kɛ vi tasinɛ a shɔwɔyi bi, shɔ bee vim au yuukɔ nɛu zɛtɔ, u shɔgbete ladurum miyi kpaiyɛ, aru u ɔ̃ aɗagbete koo yɛ yisinya yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Akɛ tɔɔnɛn shitɛ a kakani a kɔyuu tɔ nɔgbete a yɛ wiɓa ɗɔn ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Ko-pi vitasinɛ gbete piya ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ shɛ a Ɗalapa naa u pɛli shɔrɛ. Ama Ɗalapa suki ɓa au vimaanɛni ɓa, yɛ kasi ɓa nɛ ntawɔɔ a vigbete tɛwɔ kaka tɛttɔ ɓa, ama ɔ shi a kakani aru gbete shɔyɛ ntawɔyɛ yɛ ãwɔ kaka tɔ ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn ɗɔnni, kɛɗɔn yɛ ɓelɔ nyaba naa raanɛtɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Arumkɔ n shɔ ɔrinɛyi, ɔkɔ bassi vigbete au suru ɓayɛnɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />N nwarɔɔ nya naa shɔ ruuzɛnɛyi, ɔ zɛ vigbete ang shayɛtɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Kɔpi gbete au shovi awuni a ɗa Uɓeyelapa vishaanɛ tɛnɛ da a gbete u dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa: Naa ukɛ ɓoonɛ a ɗɔn yɛ, u ɗɔgbete u vɔsi Kirisi kpaayɛ. A borodi gbete u vɔsi Kirisi bi. <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Aru gbete borodiu ji gbete, u piti kpai, u bang, u bi pɛ gbete, aru u shaa jo borodi gbetenkɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Ɔ kn nɔɔ pɛ a Israilayi bi; shɔgbete i shaa vigbete shɔ n ti aru yuu ãnɛ i vɔsi jo a laa zã gbete shɔ shoshi Ɗalapa vi ɗɔn yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />N shanɛ pivi aɗɔn ni viya? Kɛɗɔn vaa ko vishaanɛ gbete shɔ ãuyɛ yɛ viwɔ tɛ ya? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Ɓa ɗɔkɔ ɓa! Vigbete ang sha aɗɔm ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ, vi a shɔ n ti aru yuu ã a laa zã shɔgbete i gɨn Ɗa ɓayɛ shɔ ã pɛ japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃, ɓanɛ shɔ ã Ɗalapa ɓa. A n ji kasi ɓanɛ ɔ ɓasi yuu a japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ niɓa. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Ɔ yɛ ɓoo ɓa au Uɓeyelapa kɔpini ɓa a sorɛ a ɓoo a japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ kɔpi ɓa; ɔ yɛ shaa ɓa a Uɓeyelapa lavipɔ̃nɛ ɔ sorɛ nɛi shaa a japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ lavipɔ̃nɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Ko ɔ kasinɛ Uɓeyelapa u kaa gɨn ya? U pɔ̃ au sisɨn nɛ u tɛu tɛttɔ a kaka ni ya? <verse eid="1CO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />&lt;&lt;Shɔ yaasiu nyaba vi pɛlinɛ tɛttɔ piti kpai,&gt;&gt;i sha jo nankɔ. Viwaa pɛ nizɛ, ama ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ko piti ɓa. &lt;&lt;Shɔ yaasiu nyaba vi pɛlinɛtɛ piti kpai&gt;&gt; ama ɓa vi piti yɛ pɔ̃siu naarɛ a vishonɛ ni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Shɔwɔ kɔ kãnɛ vigbete ɔ sisɨn kasiyɛ, ama ɔ kã jo a shɔwɔyi yuu ni piti.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Ɔ yɛ shaa vigbete shɔ mɛli a lumɔɔ yɔpɔtɔ piti kpai, ɓa aru hɨnɛni aru vigbete awɔ sisɨn ni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Aru, nɔgbete Ɗalapa nyarubii shayɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Kotipi a vigbete au yɛtini piti kpai pɛ Uɓeyelapa ɓɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Naa shɔgbete yi ã tɔ̃vɨn ɓa i kɛ ɓawɔ nya vishaanɛ nɛ, ɔkɛ kasi yɛnɛ nɛ, ɔ shaa jo vigbete awɔ ɗekɨn yɛ, ɓa a ruuwɔ hɨnɛ ni ɓa aru vigbete ɔ sɨ a sisɨn yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Ama naa shɔwɔ kɛ gelɔnɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ n ti kɨn mi pɛ vaa,&gt;&gt;kɛɗɔn ɔkɔ shaa kn wunɛ, a shɔgbete au gelɔɔyɛ yuu a vigbete ɔ sɨ a sisɨn yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />vim ɓa ɔ ruu ɓa, ɓɛɛ jo shɔwɔ ruu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">&lt;&lt;Tɔ̃vɨn, kɛɗɔn,&gt;&gt;shɔwɔ yɛ hɨtɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Aruvi n nyaba vi pɛlinɛ shɔyɛ yaasin ɓa piti ɓa aru vigbete au sisɨn yɛ viya? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Naa n kɛ dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa nɛ ang ruu vishaanɛ, shɔyɛ ɓan nii kɛpi aru vishaanɛ gbete n shaa a dɔ̃rinɛ ni viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Tɔ̃, vigbete akɛ pɛlinɛ, ko a shaatɔ ko a ɓootɔ, pɛli jo piti kpai aru Ɗalapa ni bassinɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Ɔ̃ jo nɔgbete a yɛ lɛsi Yahudawa ɓa ko shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ko wɛrɛ Ɗalapa ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Pɛli jo nɔgbete n pɛliyɛ, n kasirɛ n pɛli shɔ sisɨn puru a vigbete n pɛliyɛ ni piti kpai, ɓanɛ n lɛri vitɔ̃vɨng ang yuu ɓa, ama n pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng a shɔ yuu piti kpai, aru gbete i kpaa naa raanɛ.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Ɔ mɛsintɔ, jo nɔgbete n mɛsi Kirisi yɛ.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuu kukinɛ aɗagbete shɔ basi Ɗa yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />N ɓɛlɔɔtɔ aru gbete ɔ sisɨn ang yuu a gɨn vigbete n matɔɔyɛ ang ãwɔtɛ a naa yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Ama n kasirɛ ɔ zɛtɔ nɛ Kirisi kɔ tɛ ko-pi shɔgbete piyarɛ kakani, shɔ vɔshɔkɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete au tɛ ɓɛso kakayɛ, Ɗalapa kɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete au tɛ Kirisi kaka yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Arumkɔ shɔgbete au gaki Ɗa yɛ ko au nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubii kɛ kukiu yuunɛ si ã Kirisi yusẽtɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />A ko-pi suu gbete piya kɛ gaki Ɗa nɛ ko kɛ nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubii nɛ ji kuki yuu ɓa si ã ɓɛvɔ yusẽtɛ; i vɔsinɛ ɓa suu gbete au yuu monɛni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Naa suu gbete jo kuki yuu ɓa, yɛ zɛ nɔɔtɔ u yee suyuutɔ. A ɔ̃tɛ viyusẽ soro u moo yuurɛ ko u yeu suyuurɛ, u kuki yuutɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Ji kɔri ɓa vɔshɔ u kuki yuutɔ ɓa, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ naa Ɗalapa jasuru au bassinɛni. Ama soro bassi ɓɛjo ɓɛvɔ; <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />aru vɔshɔ shɔ jo pɛliu ɓa a soro kaa bi ɓa, ama soro shɔ pɛliu a vɔshɔ kaa bi. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Ko shɔu pɛli vɔshɔ aru soro, ama shɔ pɛli soro aru vɔshɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Aru vigbete Ɗalapa jashonɛ a lapa, kɛɗɔn ɔ̃tɛ soro u maa salabutɔ a yuuni a nɔgbete yɛ tasi nɛu pɛ a ɓɛvɔ naa. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />A shɔmni piti, u suru au Uɓeyelapa bi soro ji ɔ̃ ɓa a yɔbũ ɓa, ko vɔshɔ u ɔ̃ a yɔbũ ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Aru nagbete shɔ pɛli soro a vɔshɔ kaa bi, sɔ̃n ji nankɔ vɔshɔ pɛ soro yeurɛ; a ji Ɗalapa kɔ sɨ virɛ a suruni.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Ɔ yeerɔɔ yuu ruu pɛ ko kɔritɔ soro u gaki Ɗa a shɔ nɔɔ yuu wati u gaki Ɗa ɓa viwɔni au yuuni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Aruviya, ɔ̃nɛ a koo matiu vi tɛttɔ nɛ vɔshɔ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a suyuu rakini pɛ vi yusẽ, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />ama pɛ a soro bi vi bi kɔrinɛ. U suyuu raki shɔ ãu nɛ u ɔ̃ viyuu kukinɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Ama shɔgbete kɛ kasinɛ nɛn masi nya a rumni, vigbete n gelɔɔyɛ piti kpai ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ nɛ ko ɔ kasitɔ ko Ɗalapa wɛrɛyi ko i vilansiwɔ ɗɔn aɗɔ Ɗa bɛlinɛ ni ya?<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uɓeyelapa Vishaanɛ raantnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />A nya kɔsinɛm, n jo bɛlɔɔ ɓa nɛ aru ɔ ɗɔɔ̃nɛ basinɛ gbete ɔ pɛliyɛ lɛsi vi batɔ tɛu tɔ̃rinɛtɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Au gaanɛ, shɔ gelinɛ a tete gbete ɔ musi nya yɛ, nɛ yuu vɔsi nɛ awɔ tetteni; a shɔm n ã tɔ̃vɨntɛ a gãsi ni pɛ nizɛ. ( <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Nya maasinɛ ɓa shɔyɛ kpaa yuu vɔsinɛtɔ awɔ tetteni aru gbete shɔu zɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn yi tɔ awɔ tete ni.) <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Naa ɔ ɔ̃nɛ a ɗɔɔ zɔ kn gbete, ɓa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Uɓeyelapa vi shaanɛ gbete ɔ shaayɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Aru ɔ kɛ shaanɛ, ko-piya u yɛ ɗekɨn au vishaanɛ ni, aru gbete si shɔwɔ nwɔ siutɔ shɔwɔ ma si ɓoo miitɛ bang. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Ɔ wɛrɛ vishaanɛ ɓaya gbete ɔ yɛ shaavi aɗɔn a ɓoorɛ ɓaya? Ko ɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃ Ɗalapa wɛrɛ nɛ ruugbete nɛi pɔ̃ shɔgbete ai kasi yɛ a yusẽe ya? Ɔ kasi nɛ n gelɔɔ kɛnɛ ivi a rumni viya? N bɛlɔɔ kɛtɔ ya? N yɛn bɛlɔɔ ɓa! <verse eid="1CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Aru n tɛ vigbete n matɔɔmi pɛ a Ɗalapa naa: nɗa Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ, a zɨba gbete shɔ mɛliu yɛ, tuu borodirɛ, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />a dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa rɛ, a dalirɛ, a shanɛ,&lt;&lt; Shɔm pɛ n bi, gbete shɔ ã awɔ yuu. Ɔ pɛli nankɔ aru sisɨn kpaa nɛ ang bi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Sɔ̃n ji nyabankɔ, a knti vshaanɛ a tuu mii inabiirɛ a yɛti kɔpi a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Kɔpim pɛ Ɗalapa ruu sɔɔ gbete maa yɛ, shɔ rɛu nyatɔ ang kpaa. Ko ɔ ɓoo ɗaviya, ɔ pɛli nankɔ aru sisɨn kpaanɛ ang bi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Vim ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ kopiɗaviya ɔkɛ shaa borodim nɛ ɔkɛ ɓoonɛ a kopi mi si ɔ nwa ruu Uɓeyelapa vɔnɛtɛ se legbete sɔyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Vigbete au gɨn shɔm yɛ, naa ɔkɛ shaa borodim nɛ ɔkɛ ɓoonɛ au kɔpim a nyaba gbete ɓa tɔ̃ ɓa si ɔ pɛli Uɓeyelapa ruuvinitɛ au bi au kpaa ni. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Kɛɗɔn ɔ zɛwɔ yuu pɛjitɔ a ɗekɨn ni, nɗa ɔ shaa borodiu rɛ ɔ ɓoo kɛkn a kɔpiu ni. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Aru naa ɔ ji kpaa sisɨn ɓa a Uɓeyelapa bi ni ɓa aɗagbete ɔkɛ shaa borodiu nɛ a ɓoo a kɔpiuni, si ɔ n-tiwɔ yuu ruu yeenɛtɛ awɔ yuu naa ɔkɛ shaanɛ ɔkɛ ɓoonɛ yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Arugbetekɔ shɔzɛ waanɛ i bi vɔrɛ a ri vɔrɔrɛ, shɔwɔɔyi vɔtɛttɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Naa ukɛ zɛu yuu pẽnɛtɔ, u yɛ shi-shi ɓa a Ɗalapa ruu yeenɛ ni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Ama Uɓeyelapa yeeriu shɔ ruu tɛttɔ a yusho gɔ̃nɛ ni gboti, aru viya shɔ nyɔurɛ a shɔ kotipiyi ni ɗɔɔzɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Kɛɗɔn masayi, naa ɔkɛ toli zɔ nyanɛ nɛi shaa Uɓeyelapa vishaanɛ, ɔ gaa zɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Naa shɔwɔ awɔ tete kɛ nta nwɔnɛ u shaa vishaanɛ a wɛrɛ, u a ɗɔɔ nya tolinɛrɛ aru viya ɔ nya tolinɛ yɛ n-tiwɔ Ɗalapa ruu yeenɛrɛ a yuu a ɗɔɔ nya tolinɛni. Naa aru shɔgãsiyi, n yɛn vɔsiyitɔ nɗan kaanɛ yɛ.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Viãnɛ gbete Suru Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ Ãyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Dɔdɔrim masayi vigbete ɔ bee aru Suru Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ vi ãnɛyɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:1">N kasirɛ ɔ zɛ tɔ̃vɨntɔ ai yuuni. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ aɗagbete ɔ si doo a ɗɔɔ gbete ɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃ Ɗalapa yɛ, shɔ ɗakɔɔ a nyaba waanɛ nɛ ɔ bɛli vaa gbete u suru ɓa ɗɔn ɓayɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />N kasirɛ ɔ zɛtɔ nɛ shɔwɔ yɛ tɔ ɓanɛ nɛn a Ɗalapa Suruni u shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ shɔ wiriu tɛttɔ ɓa!&gt;&gt;shɔwɔ sɔ̃n aɗɔn ɓa au yɛ shanɛ &lt;&lt;Yesɔ u pɛ Uɓeyelapa,&gt;&gt;n ɓanɛ Suru Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ u awuni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Ɗalapa Suru vi ãnɛ tot-tot, ama jo suru gbetenkɔ ãirɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Nyaba vi shonɛ tot-tot, ama u piti kpai u shɔshi vi jo Uɓeyelapakɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Nyaba kaka vishonɛ aɗɔn tot-tot waanɛ, ama jo Ɗalapa gbetenkɔ ã shɔrɛ piti kpai ko-piya jo au vishonɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Ɗalapa tasi shɔ nyaba gbete Suru shɛshi shɔ yɛtɔ a nyaba wɔyi a ko-pi yuu piya nɛ shɔu pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng awuni piti kpai. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Ji suru gbetenkɔ ã shɔwɔ sẽrẽ a ã wɔɔ sẽrẽ vizɛnɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Shɔgbete wɔ shɔ ãu suru sẽrẽ gbete yɛ ã sisɨn a shɔwɔ bi a shɔ ã shɔwɔ kaka shɔ gati. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Suru wɔ ã shɔzɛ gbete wɔ kaka vibii zaanɛ shonɛ; shɔwɔ suru shɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubii nwarinɛ; shɔwɔ shɔ ãu pɛ nyaba vi ãnɛ gbete au shɛ a Ɗalapa Suru naa vɔsinɛ a suru gbete ɓa Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ ɓa. Shɔ ã shɔgbete wɔ shɔzatiyi nyakoo ntanɛ, shɔwɔ ma shɔ ãu Suru gbete yɛ tasi shɔ dɔɔ ruugbete shɔ shayɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Ama jo Suru gbetenkɔ pɛli vim jorɛ piti kpai; naa gbete kasiyɛ, ã shɔzɛ tot-tot vi ko-pi shɔgbetepiya.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bi Gbete u Gboki Waanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Kirisi naa bi gbete, au gboki waanɛ; ama sɔ̃njo nankɔ bi gbetenkɔ u a gbokini waanɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Sɔ̃n ji nyabankɔ u piti kpai ko Yahudawayi ko ɓa shɔgbete i Yahudawa ɓa, ko jafoo ko shɔgbete u weze, shɔ kɛ pɛliu batizima nɛ a bi gbetenkɔ aa surumkɔ, a shɔ ãu jo suru gbetenkɔ u ɓoorɛ.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Aru bi au yuu shɔ ji kɔriu ɓa a gboki gbete kɔ sheeli ɓa, ama a gboki waanɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Naa dɔɔ si shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Aru gbete n ɓa naa ɓa, n ɓa bi ɓɛɛ ɓa,&gt;&gt; shɔwakɔ yɛ Vɔsiu dɔɔɓa a biini ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Naa shoo si kɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;n ɓa nɔɔ ɓa,&gt;&gt; shɔwakɔ yɛ vɔsiu dɔɔɓa a biini ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Naa bi piti kpai si tɔnɛn ɔ̃ ji nɔɔ kɔ sheeli, si yɛ nta ɗɔɔ kɛpi koviya? Naa si tɔnɛn ɔ̃ ji shoo kɔ sheeli, siyɛ nta visẽe kɛpi koviya? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Jinagbete ɔ̃mikɔ, Ɗalapa pɔ̃ gboki tot-tot a biini, ji nɔgbete au kasiyɛ nɛu ɔ̃ yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Bi siyɛ ɔ̃ ɓa naa si tɔnɛn ɔ̃ gboki gbeteyɛ! <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Jinagbete ɔ̃mikɔ, u gboki waanɛ ama bi ji gbete.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Kɛɗɔn, nɔɔ yɛ tɔɔ ɓanɛ nɛn ɓa naa ɓa, &lt;&lt;N ji kasaa ɓa!&gt;&gt;ko yuu u geli dɔɔ nɛn, &lt;&lt;Tɔ̃, n ji kasaa ɓa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Ɓa ɗɔkɔ ɓa, u yɛ shovi dɔɔ ɓa a gboki gbete au sɨtɛ kaa vɔnɛ niɓa; <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />gboki gbete au zɛ naa i ji tesi ɓa a gãsiyini ɓa u kɔba jo ikɔ; naa gboki gbete tasi naa ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa shɔ kɔyi gaga, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />ama bi gbete kɔri tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ i ji kã kɔnɛ ɓa nagbete shɔ vɔrɔu. Ɗalapa au yuu pɔ̃ bi a ɗɔɔzɔ nɔgbete shɔu bassi gbokiwitɔ pẽnɛba au kasiyɛ <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Kɛɗɔn yuu vɔsinɛkɔ ɔ̃nɛ a biini, ama ko-pi gboki gbete piya ukɔ zɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Naa gboki gbete kɛ ɓoo raanɛ, ko-pi gboki gbete piya i ɓoo raa jo nyazɔ awuni; naa gboki wɔ shɔ kɛ bɛliunɛ, ko-pi gboki gbete piya kpaa binyatɔ̃nɛ jo. <verse eid="1CO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Ɔ piti kpai ɔ pɛ Kirisi bi, ko-pi gbete piya u pɛ gboki bi. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />A yɛti wɛrɛ Ɗa Ɗalapa pɔ̃ ko iviya tɛttɔ a nyazɔ: Ɗalapa pɔ̃u jashonɛkɔ a ɗekɨn, a pɛsi a shɔ nya waanɛyi, a pɛsi wɔsɔ̃n a shɔmalayi; kɛɗɔn kɛ shɔ vibii zaanɛ pɛlinɛyi, shɔgbete i gɨn yɛ kɛ shɔgbete shɔ ãi kaka shɔ gatinɛ ko shɔ naa pɔ̃si ko shɔ kɔnɛ ko shɔgbete i nwa shɔzatiyi nyakoo tot-tot yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />I ɓa jashonɛyi kɔ kpai ɓa ko shɔ nya waanɛyi ko shɔmalayi ɓa. Ɓa ko piya u kaka vibii zaanɛ pɛlinɛ ɗɔm ɓa <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />ko u gati vɔrɔyi ɓa ko u nwa nyashɔzati tot-tot ɓa ko u tasi shɔ dɔɔ ruugbete shɔ shayɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn a vigbete au tɛɛ vi ãnɛyi gãsiyitɔ a kɔrinɛni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Ama dɔdɔrim n yɛn tasaɔɔ vigbete au tɛɛ vi ãnɛ gãsiyitɔ piti kpai. Ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ nyaba miyi.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔvi Matinɛ Aru Ɔrinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />N yɛn zɛ nɔɔ shɔ nyakoo nwanɛtɔ a Ɗalapa jashonɛ lapayi ɓɛɛni piti kpai, ama n ɔrinɛ ji ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔn ɓa n nya nwanɛ jo nya karkinɛ weze ko toto gbete shɔ waayɛ. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />N sẽrẽ vigbete i kɛ anɛ ɗekɨn kɛ ɔ̃ nɛ a ɗɔn; ko n sẽrẽ kɛ ɔ̃ nɛ ɗɔn a viɓusinɛ zɛnɛni; ko n sisɨn ãnɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn piti kpai ang yɛn gisi kɔpɔ dɔɔtɔ yɛ, ama n ɔrinɛ ji ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔn ɓa n ɓa viwɔ ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />N yɛn zɛnɔɔ vigbete n a wuniyɛ ãnɛ tɔ piti kpai, ko n ang bi nɛ shɔu totɔ, ama n ɔrinɛ ji ɔ̃ ɓa aɗɔn ɓa, vim yɛ pɛlin vitɔ̃vɨng ɓa ang bi niɓa.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Ɔrinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ sisɨn mɛnɛ a vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ; ɔrinɛ ɓa gɨn kaanɛ ko baasinɛ ɓa; <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />ɔrinɛ basi yuu ɓa, ɔrinɛ kasi ba ɓa u yuu ɓa, ɔrinɛ sã vigɔllɔrɔ ɓa a sisɨn ni ɓa; <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />ɔrinɛ kasi vikɔ̃linɛ ɓa, ama binyatɔ̃nɛ a tɔ̃vɨn ni. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Ɔrinɛ lɛri ɓa; au sisɨn ãnɛ ni, a sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ, au sisɨn mɛnɛ ni ɓa.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Ɔrinɛ sɔ̃nya ɓa. Ɔrinɛ geli shɔ ruutɔ̃vɨng, ama i ɓa dangdang ɓa; sẽrẽ nyakoo tot-tot nwanɛ aɗɔn, ama i yɛ sɔ̃nyatɔ; ruu zɛnɛ aɗɔn, ama yɛ tɛɛtɔ. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Aru u sẽrẽ vizɛnɛ a ruu nyawaanɛ ji yii ɓa; <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />ama shɔ tɔ̃vɨn i kanɛ, kɛɗɔn vigbete si ji yii ɓa yɛ niikɛtɔ.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />A ɗagbete sin jabẽrẽti yɛ, n nyanwanɛ naa jajja ɓɛɛ, n ntavi naa jajja a ruu lɛrinɛ ni si jo naa jabẽrẽtiyi ɓɛɛ; dɔdɔrim ang batɛ mi, n pɛli vi tɔɓa a nyaba jajja ni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Vigbete u zɛ dɔdɔrim ɔ̃ jasuru zɨnan-zɨnan a zɛlivini; u yɛu zɛzɔ nɔkɨntɔ. Vigbete n zɛ dɔdɔrim i ɓa bang ɓa; kɛɗɔn n yɛn zɛkɛ piti kpai naa Ɗalapa vi zɛnɛ ang yuu. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Vi taati miyi i ɔ̃ jinankɔ: ukɔ sisɨn ãnɛ, sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ a ɔrinɛ; a shɔgbete ɔ̃ pẽnibayɛ ukɔ ɔrinɛ.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Vimatinɛ Ayuu Viãnɛ Gbete Ɗa Suru ã Shɔyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Ɔ mabii jo aru zɔ ɔrinɛ, ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn a vigbete Ɗasuru ãyɛ i kãnɛ, naa shɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubii tɔ̃vɨn nwanɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Shɔgbeteyi i nwanya shɔzati wɔɔyi yɛ i ji nwa ɓa a shɔwɔyini ɓa ama i nwanya pɛ a Ɗalapa aru shɔwɔɔ ntayi nya shɔzatiu ɓa. I nwanya ruutɔ̃vɨng ɓusinɛ gbete Ɗasuru ãi yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Ama shɔgbete i nwari shɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubii yɛ, i nwanya a shɔni a pɔ̃siyi naarɛ a bilakinɛni wɔsɔ̃n a sisɨn roorinɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Shɔgbeteyi nwanya ai nya shɔzatiyi yɛ i pɔ̃si naa ɓɛjo ai yuukɔ sheeli, ama shɔgbete i nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubii i pɔ̃si naa ɓɛjo shɔ Da gɨnnɛyikɔ piti kpai.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />N yɛn kasitɔ ɔ nwanya a nya shɔzati piti kpai; ama n kasirɛ ɔ nwari shɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubii, aru shɔgbete nwari shɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubii tɛɛ shɔgbeteyi nwanya shɔzati tot-tot yɛ tɛttɔ. Ama naa shɔu kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a shɔruu dɔɔtanɛni yɛ pɔ̃si shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi naatɔ piti kpai i zɛ ruwu dɔɔ rɛ.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Kɛɗɔn masayi naa nkɛ awɔ ɗɔbi nɛ n nwanya a ɔkɔni a nya shɔzati gbete ɔ nta ɓayɛ n nyanwanɛu yɛ ɔ̃kɛ pikovi tɔ̃vɨn awɔ ɗɔbi ni n tasɔɔ dɔɔ ruu aru vizɛnɛ ko Ɗanyaruubii nwarinɛ ko shɔvi matinɛ a nyaba Ɗa nyaruubiini viya?<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ aru vigbete i ɓa a suru ni ɓa, naa vɨtaa i yeenya shɛ ɓa waanɛ ɓa, shɔwɔɔ yɛ nta vigbeteyi gee yɛ ko i waa yɛ kɛpiko viya? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Naa shɔji gee vigeenɛ ɓa a kakani ɓa, piya zɛnɔɔ bimanɛ pi aru bawaanɛni piya? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Sɔ̃nji nyabankɔ, shɔ yɛ nta ruugbete ɔkɛ shanɛ a nya shɔzati naa ji shɛ ɓili ɓa kɛpi koviya? Ɔ nya yɛ sãti ɓɛjo ayuu sɔrɔ wezeǃ <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Nyakoo aɗɔn a kotipini tot-tot waanɛ, ko-pi shɔgbete piya u vishonɛ aɗɔn. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Naa n ji nta nyakou gbete shɔ nwayɛɓa, shɔgbete i nwa nyau pɛ shɔzatiyi ang ɗɔɔ biini ang yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo shɔzati ai ɗɔɔ biini. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Jinankɔ awɔ ɗɔbiini, nagbete ɔ zanɛyi si kpaa vi ãnɛ gbete Ɗasuru ãyɛtɔ, ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨn a kɔrɔɔ se ɔ lakibii ayuu vigbete pẽnɛba ɔyɛ pɛliyɛ piti kpai Ɗalapa nyaruubii uyɛ ɗekɨn yɛ.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Aru nankɔ shɔgbete ai nwanya a nya shɔzatiyɛ, kɛɗɔn ɔ̃riyitɛ kaka jazɨn a kɔrɔ i gaki Ɗatɔ u ãi sẽrẽ ruu dɔɔtanɛ gbete shɔ shayɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Aru n kɛ gaki Ɗa nɛ a nyabankoo, pɛn n suru gaki Ɗarɛ, ama n sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ ɓa ɗɔni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Kɛɗɔn n yɛn pɛli kɛpikoviya? N yɛn gaki Ɗa kɛ ang suru, ama n yɛn gaki Ɗa sɔ̃n ang sisɨn; n yɛn ntɔ so Ɗa nii bɛlinɛ ang suru wɔsɔ̃n ang sisɨn. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Naa a ji pɛli ɓa dɔkɔ ɓa, akɛ dɔ̃ri Ɗa nɛ aa surukɔ sheeli, yɛ ɔ̃ kɛ pikovi a shɔgbete i ji zɛvi ɓa i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Nankɔ,&gt;&gt;ayuu dɔ̃rinɛ gbete a pɛliyɛ, naa i ji nta vigbete a shayɛ ɓa viya? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Aru gbete a dɔ̃ri Ɗalapatɛ waanɛ, ama mɛzɔ̃yi i ji kpaa viwɔ ɓa atete vigbete a shayɛ niɓa. <verse eid="1CO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />N dɔ̃ri Ɗalapatɛ waanɛ aru n nwanya shɔzati wɔɔyitɔ tot-tot ntɛ̃ɔrɛ piti kpai. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Ama a shomni piti kpai aɗɔgbete moo shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi toli nya gee Ɗa nya aɗɔnyɛ n nwanya a ruu tot-tot maani gbete iyɛ ntattɔ nɔgbete i yɛ mati shɔwɔɔyi vi i zɛrɛyɛ, ɓa nɛ nwanya a ruu tot-tot waanɛ a nya shɔzati wɔɔyi ɓa.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Masayi ɔ vizɛnɛ kɔ ɔ̃nɛ naa jajja ɓɛɛ; ɔ pɛli nankɔ aɗɔ vikɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛ naa jajja bɛ̃rɛ̃tiyi, ama aru Ɗalapa gɨnnɛ ɔ pɛli vi naa shɔruu zɛnɛyi. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Shɔ beetetɔ a Musa ãsinɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">&lt;&lt;N yɛ shovi a shɔgbete i nwanya a nya shɔzati wɔɔyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">N nwanya ang shɔbiiyini, Uɓeyelapa sharɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">N yɛn nwanya a yini a shɔzatiyi nyakoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">a shɔmi kpai n shɔbiiyi ji wesho ɓa ang nyani ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗa Suru viãnɛ aru nyanwanɛ a nyakoo tot-tot, ɓa shɔgbete i ã sisɨntɛ a Ɗabiini i ɓɛɛ ɓa ama pɛ shɔgbete i ji ãsisɨn ɓa Ɗa biini ɓa i ɓɛɛ, viãnɛ aru Ɗalapa nyaruubii nwanɛ pɛ shɔgbete i ãsisɨntɛ Ɗa bi i ɓɛɛ, ɓa shɔgbete iji ãsisɨn ɓa ɓɛɛ ɓa.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Aru nankɔ naa shɔ Ɗalapa gɨnnɛyi i kɛ toli nyanɛ ko-piya aɗɔgbete nwanya a nyakoo wɔɔ tot-tot, naa shɔgbete i ji zɛvi ɓa ko shɔgbete iji ãsisɨn ɓa Ɗa biini ɓa ikɛ to ɗɔunɛ i sha ɓa nɛ ɔ rirãntɛ ɓaya? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Ama naa ko-piya kɛ nwanyanɛ aru Ɗalapa nyaruubiini aɗagbete shɔ ai ji zɛvi ɓa a shɔgbete i ji ãsisɨn ɓa a Ɗanyaruubiini ɓa ikɛ to ɗɔunɛ,iyɛ zɛ kɛkn nɛi pɛ shɔ ruuvini ayuu ruu vigbete i ntayɛni, kɛɗɔn iyɛ yeeri i yuu ruu kɛkn yuu nɛi pɛ shɔruuvini. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />I ruukɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛ sisɨn yɛ shɛ kɛkn a ɓelin. A nyabankɔ i taa a yugboti a gee Ɗa nyarɛ a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Nizɛ kɔ Ɗalapa u pɛ awɔ atete ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya ãsinɛ a Ɗa wɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Masayi shompɛ nɔgbete viwu ɔ̃yɛ. Aɗagbete ɔkɛ toli nyannɛ aru Ɗa nii ɓɛlinɛ, shɔwɔɔ yɛ u ɔ̃ shɔ so Ɗa nii bɛlinɛ ntaanɛ, shɔwɔɔ u ɔ̃ shɔgbete matinɛ shɔvi aru Ɗalapa nyaruubii, shɔwɔɔ u ɔ̃ shɔgbete tasi shɔ dɔɔ nɔgbete ruwu ɔ̃yɛ, shɔwɔɔ u ɔ̃ shɔgbete yɛ nwanya a nyakoo wɔɔ yɛ, shɔwɔɔ sɔ̃njo shɔgbete tadɔɔ ruuyɛ. Ko iviya ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a lakɔrɔ u pɔ̃ Ɗalapa nyaruubii u yɛ ɗekɨn. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Naa shɔwɔɔ awɔ tete yɛ nwanya a nyakoo wɔɔ tot-tot, ikɔ tɛɛ shɔzɛ taatinɛ gbete iyɛ nwanya yɛ nɛ, i nwanya jo gbete akɨnti gbete, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a lakɔrɔ shɔzɛ gbete awɔ tete u tadɔɔ vigbete i shayɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Ama naa shɔgbete yɛ tadɔɔ ruu ji ɔ̃ ɓa, kɛdɔn kopiya a tolinɛ shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛwi a ɗɔuyɛ i ɔ̃ shok, i gaki Ɗarɛ ai sisɨn. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Shɔgbete ai nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubii ziti ko taati i nwanyarɛ, gãsi shɔwiyi se i gaa rɛ i yeeruu ayuu vigbete ai shayɛni. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Ama naa shɔwɔɔ awɔ a ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ atette shɔgbete ai ɗɔuni tɛɛ Ɗanyaruubiitɛ, shɔu au ɗɔ nyanwanɛu u shirɛ shok. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ɔ piti kpai ɔ zɛnɔɔ shɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubii nwarinɛtɔ gbete gbete, a nɔgete kopiya yɛ mativirɛ u bi u lakirɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Janyagadi suru ukɔ kɔyirɛ i pɛliyi vishonɛrɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Aru Ɗalapa u pɛ Ɗalapa gbete n ti binyatɔ̃nɛ yɛ, ama ɓa gbete n ti yukɔnɛ yɛ ɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">A Ɗa wɛrɛ aɗɔgbete shɔ gɨnnɛyi i toli nya aɗɔnyɛ, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />soroyi ɔ̃ a nyani a ɗɔgbete shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛ i toli nya a ɗɔnyɛni, aru gbete shɔ ji ãi naa ɓa nɛi nwanyarɛ ɓa, i ɓɛɛ ɓɛjo gɨnnɛ vigbete nyaãsinɛ ãsiyɛ gɨnnɛ sheeli. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />I kɛ kasi viwɔ ntanɛ nɛ a vigbete shɔ shayɛ ni, i yɛ hɨ ɓɛjo i ɓɛvɔ a wɛrɛ, pɛ viyusẽ soro u nwanya aɗɔgbete shɔ toli nya shɔ maruu a Ɗa wɛrɛni.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Ɔ tunɛ Ɗalapa nyaruubii gaa ji awɔ bi koya ko aa jo awɔ ruubiikɔ sheeli ya? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Shɔwɔ kɛ tunɛ nɛn pɛ janyagadi ko shɔgbete tunɛ nɛn a vigbete suru ãnyɛ aɗɔn, kɛɗɔn u zɛtɔ nɛ vigbete n beerɔɔmi pɛ Uɓeyelapa nya ãsinɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Shɔgbete ji weshoo ɓa a nyani ãsinɛni ɓa, ɔkɔ weshoo nɛ au nyani.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Kɛɗɔn masayi ɔ ɔ̃ sisɨn Ɗanyaruubii nwanɛni, ama ɔkɔ zãri shɔgbete i nwanya a nyakoo wɔɔyi tot-tot nyanwanɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Ɔ̃rii kopiyatɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u pɛli vishonɛ jo tɔ̃vɨn nɔgbete Ɗa yɛ tɛyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Kirisi yunɛ saa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Masayi dɔdɔrim n kasɔɔ sisɨn kparinɛ aru tɔ̃vɨn gbete n nwarɔɔ yɛ, gbete ɔ tɛyɛ a gbete ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ shi au yuu yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Ji a Ɗanyaruubii gbete n nwarɔɔ yɛmkɔ ɔ yɛ kpaa naraanɛrɛ, naa ɔkɛ sã naa nɛ aɗɔn katakata, ama naa ɔ ji sã ɓa naa kaziti si ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ji wati weze.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />N gelɔɔ jo vigbete n tɛyɛ, gbete u vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn aɗɔn pẽnɛba yɛ: aru gbete Kirisi vɔ au ruuvini yɛ, nɔgbete shɔ bee a labeenɛ Ɗanyaruubiiyɛ nɛ; <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />Kirisi vɔrɛ shɔ gbãurɛ Ɗalapa yusiu lapa a saa a knti lee taati nɔgbete shɔ bee a laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii yɛ; <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Nɛ shɛ a Bulus bi, kɛɗɔn a shɛ sɔ̃n au jashonɛyi kopi atu zitiyi ɗekɨn piti kpai. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Kɛɗɔn shɛ au shɔ gɨnnɛyi bi gbete i tɛɛ laa maani ɓa maani tɛttɔ nɔgbete, shɔgãsiyi waanɛ i doo a suruni, ama shɔwɔɔyi vɔtɛttɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Kɛɗɔn shɛ a Yakub ɗekɨn, a kɨntiuni shɛ sɔ̃nrɛ au jashonɛ wɔɔyi ɗekɨn piti kpai.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />A kɨntiuni kpai shɛ sɔ̃n ang ɗekɨn, ama sin n ji yɛɓa a nɔgbete si shɛ ang ɗekɨn yɛni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Aru sin pẽtẽrẽ au tete jashoɛyini, n ji yɛɓa shɔu ɓan nɛu jashonɛ ɓa, aru gbete n tasi shɔ gɨnnɛyi raatɔ waanɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Ama aru Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ kɔ sinrɛ n kpang yuutɛ a nogbete n ɗɔnyɛ, u tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ ang bii u yuukonɛ ɓa. A naa kawɔ n tɛɛ shɔ wɔyi tɛttɔ a vishonɛ pɛlinɛni, siɓa n kɔ nizɛ n pɛli vishonɛurɛ ɓa, ama sipɛ Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shovirɛ ang nkɔ ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Kɛɗɔn ko nkɔ ko ikɔyi, n pɛ vigbete u piti kpai u waayɛ, a n pɛ vigbete ɔ ã tɔ̃vɨn aɗɔnyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vimatinɛ ayuu ruu yunɛ Saa a Suruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Dɔdɔrim u nya gbete u nwari shɔyɛ nɛ Kirsi yulapatɛ a saani, ɔ shɔ gãsiyi i shakɛpi kɔvi nɛ vɔrɔ yulapa a suruni ɓa viya? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Shɔwa kɛ ɔ̃nɛ nizɛ, si tasinɛ Kirisi shɔjo yusiu lapa ɓa a saani ɓa; <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />a naa Kirisi ji yulapa ɓa a saani ɓa, kɛɗɔn siu vi nya waanɛ ɓa a vi sisɨn ãnɛ ni ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Tɛɛ nam tɛttɔ, shɔ tasiu kɛ naa u yeelinyatɛ aru Ɗalapa ni, aru gbete u shanɛ ukɔ yusi Kirisi laparɛ a saa ni, ama kɛ ɔ̃nɛ nizɛ nɛ vɔrɔ ji yulapa ɓa a saa ni a suruni ɓa, kɛɗɔn si shɔ ji yusi Kirisi ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Aru naa si vɔrɔyi ji yulapa ɓa saani ɓa, yɛ ɔ̃ ji nankɔ a Kirisi ni si ji yulapa ɓa saani ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />A naa si shɔ ji yusi Kirisi ɓa, kɛɗɔn si ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ɔ̃ tɛ nyazɔ̃ a si ɔ nitɛ a ruuvini ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Yɛ tasi sɔ̃n jo nɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ai ã sisɨn a Kirisi bi yɛ ai vɔyɛ i nitɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Naa u sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ a kirisi bi kɛ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn aru ɔ̃ nɛmkɔ sheeli wɔɔ ɓa, kɛɗɔn u ntɔ ɔ̃nɛ raa nta nɛ au tɛɛ kopiyatɛ a kotipim piti kpai.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Ama ruu tɔ̃vɨn nizɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ yusi Kirisi lapa tɛttɔ a saani, a saa a suruni, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete au gaa noroo vɔnɛ roonɛ yɛ, shɔyɛ yusilapatɔ a saani a suru ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Naa gbete vɔrɔ aa shɔzɛ gbete kabii, jinankɔ vɔrɔ yunɛ a saa a suru ni yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo a shɔzɛ kabiikɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Ji nagbete kopiya yɛ vɔ aru Adamu yuu yɛ, sɔ̃nji nankɔ shɔyɛ yusiyi lapa a suru ni a Kirisi yuu. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Ama yɛ ɔ̃ a kɨ̃nkɨ̃n, Kirisi yɛ gaa yunɛrɛ, kɛdɔn aɗagbete yɛ sɔ yɛ shɔgbete u ɓɛɛ iyɛ yu kɛkn. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Kɛɗɔn u nyayisinɛ yɛ atɔ; Aɗagbete yɛ sɔri Ɗalapa uɓeye shɔgbete i roo kpatiyɛ, yupɛ̃niyi a kakayi, yɛ sɔri Ɗa kpati roonɛ kɛ Uɓeye a naa. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Ɔ̃ri Kirisitɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u roo kpati, setɛ Ɗalapa nali u shɔnɔpɔ̃itɛ a zɛyi knti piti kpai. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Shɔnɔpɔ̃ gbete Kirisi yɛ nau au dɔɔ au nyayisinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vɔrɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Aru Ɗalapa laaneenɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa pɔ̃ ko iviya tɛttɔ au tele ɗɔɔ.&gt;&gt;ama naa gbete shɔ shatettɔ wasak nɛ,&lt;&lt;vi piti kpai&gt;&gt;nɛ Ɗalapa au yuu u ɓa ɓusɨn ni ɓa, gbete pɔ̃ ko iviyatɛ a Kirisi tele dɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Ama aɗagbete shɔ pɔ̃ ko iviya a Kirisi tele dɔɔ nɛu ɔ̃ a Kirsi kpati roonɛ yɛ, kɛɗɔn Kirisi au yuu, u jaa yɛ pɔ̃u a Ɗalapa tele dɔɔ, gbete yɛ pɔ̃ ko iviya jiu nakɔ; Ji Ɗalapa kɔ sheeli ukɔ sã ko iviyarɛ piti kpai a koo.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Si ɓa ɗɔkɔ ɓa, dɔdɔrim ruwu u dɔɔtanɛ kɛnɛ ivi aru gbete ɔ shɔ gãsiyi i shanɛ, shɔ pɛli shɔmiyi batizima kɛnɛ vi aru yunɛ saa a suru ni viya? Naa ruu yunɛ a saa a suruni i ji ɔ̃ ɓa, shɔ pɛli shɔwɔɔyi batizima kɛnɛ viya aru yunɛ a suru ni a saa ni viya? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Aru iviya kopi ɗaviya u ɗɔyunɛ atette yukɔnɛ viya? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Masayi pɛ nizɛ kɔ, ko-pi lee piya setɛ n kpaa yukɔnɛ vɔnɛtɛ! Aru basinɛ gbete n nwa awɔ yuu a ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ gbete n ɔ̃ a nyazɔ̃ a Kirisi Yesɔ Uɓeyelapa yɛ, ukɔ pɔ̃nrɛ n sha vimrɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Si ɔ̃nɛ naa vigbete shɔzɛ kasi pɛlinɛ au sisɨn yɛ, n si waabatɔ a viɓeliyini a Afisa, aru shɔzɛ n vi baasinɛ kɛ iviya, ama n ɓɛɛ vitɔ̃vɨng kɛ iviya naa shɔji yusi vɔrɔyi ɓa a suruni a saani viya? Nagbete shaliyɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt; u shaavinɛ a ɓooni, aru ɓuru uyɛ vɔtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Ɔkɔ ɗakaɔɔ yuunɛ!&lt;&lt;ɔ̃nɛ a shɔ lanɛyini ukɔ lɛsi ɔ̃nɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn yirɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Ɔ sɔ nɔgbete si ɔ lɛriyɛ tɔ awɔ sisɨn ni ɔ yaa nyaba ruuvini pɛlinɛ kati. N sha vim nɗa yusẽ u sãwɔtɔ aruviya ɔ shɔ gãsiyi ji zɛ Ɗalapa ɓa.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vimatinɛ nɔgbete Bi lapa yunɛ a suru ni yɛ ɔ̃ yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Shɔwɔɔ yɛ hɨnɛ,&lt;&lt; shɔ yusi vɔrɔ pikovi a suru ni viya? I bi yɛ ɔ̃ kɛpi koviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Mɔkɔ shɔ rãmǃ Naa akɛ ɓaa nɔvinɛ a tipi, yɛ taa gapa ɓa setɛ vɔtɛttɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Vigbete a ɓaa yɛ ɓaukɔ yɛ taarɛ ɓa, pɛ nɔɔ zɔvi sheeli, ko zɔ̃vi zee ko zɔvi iri viwɔ tot. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Ama Ɗalapa pɔ̃urɛ u ɔ̃ iri zɔ̃vi gbete kasiyɛ; kopi nɔɔzɔ̃vi shopiya Ɗalapa pɔ̃yi bi jo nɔgbete iyɛ ɔ̃ yɛ.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Aru vigbete i a kotipi a suru ni i yɔpɔ bi ɓa zɔ̃n gbete ɓa; Shɔzɛyi ɓɛɛji tot, vivaayi ɓɛɛji tot, janoyi ɓɛɛji tot a jazɨnyi ɓɛɛji tot.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Aru bi kolapa a kotipi i ji ɗɔn; kɔrinɛ shɔ kolapa i tot-tot a kɔrinɛ shɔ kotipini. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />ɗaa ji au Kɔrinɛ, shɛllɛ a see i kɔrinɛni tot-tot, seewɔɔ atete seeyi i u kɔrinɛ tot au gãsiyini.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Yɛ ɔ̃ji nankɔ a lee gbete vɔrɔyi yɛ yuu a saa yɛ, shɔ gbã vɔrɔ aru pntirɛ, pɛ bi vɔrɛ ama naa shɔkɛ yusinɛ a saa iyɛ vɔtɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Naa shɔkɛ gbãnɛ kɔri ɓa nɔɔni ɓa wɔsɔ̃n i bi laki ɓa; Ama naa shɔkɛ yusiyi nɛ, kɔritɔ nɔɔni, i bi lakitɔ waanɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Aɗa gbãnɛ a nɔɔ pɛ gbutu bi; Ama aɗa yusinɛ naa suru. Aru pɛ shɔzɛ gbutu bi nizɛ kɛ ɔ̃ ɗɔn, jinankɔ bi u ɔ̃ a suru ni ɗɔn. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Aru laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔu a Ɗa gau shɛshɛnɛ a koo, pɛ Adamu, Ɗa mau nɛu ɔ̃ a suru niyɛ&gt;&gt;Ama Adamu shɔ nyayisinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Yesɔ Kirisi, gbete ã shɔ Ɗa suru yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Ama ɓa suru bikɔ gaa shɛnɛrɛ ɓa, pɛ shɔ shɔzɛ gaa shɛnɛrɛ, kɛɗɔn a kɨntiuni kɛ Ɗasuru shɛrɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Adamu shɔ gaanɛ shɛ a kotipi gbete shɔ mau a tipi yɛ, shɔu pɛsiuyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Yesɔ Kirisi gbete shɛ a kolapa yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Shɔgbete i shɛ kotipiyɛ i ɔ̃ ji naa shɔ kotipiyi, ji naa nɔgbete shɔgbete i shɛ a kolapa yɛ, i ɔ̃ ji naa shɔgbete ai a kolapa yɛ yikɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Ji naa nɔgbete au jasuru naa shɔgbete au shɛ a kotipim ɓɛɛ ɔ̃ yɛ, au jasuru yɛ ɔ̃ji naa shɔgbete au shɛ a kolapam ɓɛɛkɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Masayi n gelɔɔ vim aru yɛ pɛli ɓa yɔpɔ a kpaani i kpaa ɗɔɔ̃nɛrɛ a Ɗa kpati roonɛ niɓa, jinankɔ vipunnɛ yɛ kpaa vigbete pun ɓa yɛ ɗɔɔ̃nɛrɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Ɔ weshopɛ ruu ɓuzɨn nizɛ gbete n yɛ gelɔɔmiː u yɛ vɔɓa piti kpai ɓa, ama naa shɔkɛ gee gãntinɛ nyayisinɛ, u piti kpai u yɛ kɔsiu kɛtɔ, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />ji weze tɛ̃ɛ̃ti naa jaa nɔɔ riyɛ. Aru naa gbete ukɛ nta gãntinɛ nɛ yɛ, vɔrɔyi yɛ yulapatɔ, iyɛ vɔ tɔkɨn ɓa, u piti kpai u yɛ kɔsi kɛtɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Aru vigbete pun ɓa yɛ, u kɔsirɛ u ɔ̃ vigbete puntɔ yɛrɛ; vigbete yɛ vɔtɔyɛ, u kɔsirɛ u ɔ̃ vigbete yɛ vɔɓa yɛrɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Kɛɗɔn naa vim kɛ pɛlinɛ nankɔ, vigbete punɓa u kɔsirɛ u ɔ̃ vigbete yɛ puntɔ yɛrɛ, kɛɗɔn Ɗanyaruubii yɛ ɔ̃kɛ nizɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa lɛsi vɔrɔtɛ a ɗekɨn yɛnɛ gbete u kpaayɛ niǃ &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />&lt;&lt;Vɔrɔ a shaarinɛu kɛpiya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">vɔrɔ a kaka shɔ lɛsinɛu kɛpiya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Vɔrɔ kpaa kaka shɔ lɛsinɛ a ruuvini, ruuvini kpau kaka shɔ lɛsinɛ sɔ̃njo a nya ãsinɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Ama dɔ̃rinɛ yɛnɛ a Ɗalapa bi a kaa Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi!<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Kɛɗɔn n shɔ ɔrinɛ masayi, ɔ shi dɔɔ kaziti ko leepiya a bi maani. Ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a Uɓeyelapa vishonɛ pɛlinɛni, naa gbete ɔ zɛtɛtɔ nɛ, vigbete ɔ pɛli Uɓeyelapa yɛ ɓa weze ɓa.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Vi ãnɛ Aru Shɔ Sisɨn Ãnɛ Gbete I Kasiyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Dɔdɔrim aru naa pɔ̃sinɛ gbete ɔ shanɛ u pɔ̃si shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛ gbete i a Galantiya yɛ, ɔ̃raɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ɔ pɛli vigbete n geli shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi a Galantiya i pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Ko-pi leegbete piya a shɔ gɨnnɛ i toli nya yɛ, ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ a ɓuzɨn vigbete kpaa yɛ ni, u pɔ̃ viwɔɔtɔ, ɓa nɛ setɛ ɗau atɛ nɗa ɔ toli saa kɛkn ɓa. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Aɗagbete naa atɛ, nɗa n sho shɔgbete ɔ lɔyi nɛi pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn awɔ atette a sẽkoni, nɗai n ti ɔ vinaa pɔ̃sinɛuni yɛnɛ Urushalima. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Kɛ kɔrinɛtɔ n yɛ ayini, i yɛ zɛnɔɔ i gɨnrɛ u yɛrɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vigbete Bulus maa nɛn pɛliyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />N yɛ awɔ ɗɔbiitɔ akɨnti gbete naa yisi rakinɛtɛ a tipi Makidoniyani piti kpai, aru n yɛ za jo tipi Makidoniyakɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Wɔɓa n yɛ ɔ̃tɔ a ɔkɔni lee ziti, ko n yɛ shaa goosi jo a ɔkɔni nɗa ɔ dɔ̃n dɔɔ a ɗɔgbete n yɛn yɛ, yɛ ni piti kpai. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />N ji kasi ɓa n zɛɔrɛ n tɛrɛ weze ɓa, ama n pɔ̃ sisɨn ntɔ n kasirɛ n ɔ̃ a ɔkɔni lee ziti naa Uɓeyelapa kɛ kasinɛ yɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Ama n yɛ ɔ̃jo tipi Afisa mkɔ yɛnɛ lee yumusinɛ pasika. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Aru shɔ ɓelin nyaba vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛtɛ pɛ̃niɓa a ɗɔmni, ama shɔnɔpɔ̃yi i sɔ̃njo ɗɔuni waanɛ gbete i kasin vishonɛ pɛlinɛ zãrinɛyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Naa Timoti kɛ awɔ ɗɔbiinɛ ɔ tɛu nakaziti awɔ tetteni, aru ukɔma pɛlijo Uɓeyelapakɔ vishɔnɛ naa gbete n pɛlimyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Shɔwɔkɔ pɛliu vikɔ̃linɛ nɛ, ama ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ɔ dɔ̃u dɔɔtɔ a binyatɔ̃nɛ, u sɔn ɗɔbiirɛ, n a ɗɔgbete n pɔ̃nɔɔ a nyaba aru u ɗɔɔ anɛ a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ wɔɔyini.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Aru u ɓezɔ̃ Apolosi, n gakiutɛtɔ waanɛ u awɔ ɗɔbiitɔ a shɔ gãsi shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyini, ama anɛ dɔdɔrim u sisɨn ji tɛ tɔ̃ɓa, yɛ atɔ aɗagbete zɛrɛ kɔritɔ u a yɛ ni.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya vasinɛ dangdang a nya geenɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Ɔ nɔkãkãri, ɔ shi dɔkaziti awɔ nyaba sisɨn ãnɛni, ɔ mabiitɔ a abi lakinɛni ɔkɔ nta setinɛ. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Vigbete ɔ kɛ pɛlinɛ yɛ ɔ pɛli a ɓuzɨn zɔ̃ ɔrinɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Mazɔ̃yi ɔ zɛtɛttɔ Istifanu au shɔ wɛrɛyini kpai ikɔyi gaa Kirisita rinɛrɛ a tipi Akaya, i ãi yuu tɛttɔ aɗɔ shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi vishonɛ pɛlinɛ. N gaki ɔtɔ masayi, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />ɔ gɨn iri shɔmiyi nyatɔ naa shɔm, a shɔgbete u pɛli vishonɛ ɗɔgbete ayini piti kpai wɔsɔ̃n a shɔgbete i ɓoo raan ayini nyazɔ̃ yini yɛ ni.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />N nta yɛti purutɔ a Istifanu, Fɔtunatu a Akaiku a nɛni, aru i n-tiɔ vigbete au si ɓa awuni ɓa yɛtɛ <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />I sintɛ n nta tɔ̃vɨntɛ a ɔkɔni, jo naa i sɨwɔ sɔ̃njo yɛ. Shɔ naa shɔmiyi ɔ weshootɔ ai a nyani.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛ gbeteyi a tipi Asiya i gewɔ nyatɛ kpai; Akila a Piskila a shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛ gbete a toli nya ai wɛrɛ yɛ i gewɔ nyatɛ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ au ruu Uɓeyelapa. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ gbete i a ɗɔmyɛ i gee wɔ nyatɛ piti kpai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Ɔ gee zɔ nyajo a binyatɔ̃nɛ wɔsɔ̃n a zɔ naa kɔ̃tinɛ bi nagbete Kirisita i pɛliyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Nkɔ Bulus ang naa n beerɔɔ nya geenɛmrɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Shɔgbete ji ɔriu Uɓeyelapa ɓa shɔu wiriutɔǃ (Marana tha)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">Uɓeyelapa anɛǃ<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ shɔ vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔni.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />N gee wɔ nyatɛ, nya geenɛ zɔ ɔrinɛ piti kpai au Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi nii.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>